+        "zhHansManuscript": "资源与财富的重点，不在于把财星简单理解为钱财多寡，而在于既有的伤官生财路径能否被稳定承载。水的结构显著度使知识、技术、判断、表达与解决问题的能力容易向外流动，再由木财承接为项目、交易、客户需求、可交付成果或具体责任。月干偏财明透，地支又见正财与偏财暗藏，说明财富议题既有公开可见、需要主动把握的一面，也有嵌在长期安排、细节义务与持续经营之中的一面。这里能够确认的是变现通道具有结构基础，却不能据此推定财富规模，更不能把机会出现等同于成果已经留存。\n\n这一区分尤其重要：收入形成与财富保留并不是同一件事。伤官生财擅长把想法、能力与市场需求连接起来，但日主处于偏弱一侧时，输出越旺，随之而来的交付、管理、沟通和后续责任也越多。若只追求更多项目、更快周转或更广覆盖，表面上的业务增长可能领先于实际承载能力。现实中，这常体现为能够发现机会、提出方案并推动成交，却需要额外处理时间成本、质量控制、履约边界和持续维护。结构真正要求的不是压低输出，而是让每一次输出都由足够的流程、储备和执行能力接住。\n\n比肩多见，使资源运作带有明显的自主性与同层协作色彩。它可以表现为依靠自身判断推进，也可以表现为与伙伴、同业或团队共同调动资源。其有利之处在于遇到任务时并非全无支点，能够通过分工、复核和共同执行扩大承载；其压力面则是资源也可能在多人、多项目或多重优先事项之间被分流。比肩并不自动代表竞争或破财，但当权限、成本、收益与责任没有清楚界定时，原本用于支持的协作关系就可能增加协调损耗。反之，规则透明、职责可核验时，共享资源反而能保护伤官生财不因个人负荷过重而失真。\n\n土印是这一财富结构中更关键的承载条件。偏印分布于地支而未直接透出，意味着支持并非不存在，只是较多藏在后台：学习积累、专业框架、资料系统、风险预留、复盘能力以及可恢复的工作节奏，都属于这种承载方式。因为印星多藏，现实中的支持未必总以显眼的资本或明确援助出现，往往要通过制度、习惯和基础建设才能真正发挥作用。若忽略这些不易被看见的成本，便容易把全部注意力放在前端机会，直到履约压力积累后才发现后台不足。土为首要用神、金为辅助，所强调的正是先稳住主体与执行基础，再让输出和财星继续流通。\n\n压力升高时，这一结构较容易出现的失真，是用更多表达、更多方案或更多承诺去解决已经属于承载不足的问题。于是忙碌可能增加，实际完成度却未同步提升；收入可能形成，留存却被追加投入、协作成本或未结责任消耗。偏财的灵活性若缺少印比支撑，可能变成目标不断外扩；伤官的效率导向若没有边界，也可能使尚未成熟的安排过早进入交付阶段。这些都不是必然事件，而是结构在负荷超过承载时的常见方向。较顺畅的状态则是将价值主张、价格条件、交付范围与后续责任放在同一套安排中，使所得与所担相称，让完成一项安排本身成为财富保留的一部分。\n\n调候层面保留火的候选意义，是为了回应冬令寒湿背景下的温暖与流通，但它不能与扶抑、格局用神混为一谈，也不能直接被解释为财富越多越好。火若在具体时序中出现，仍须观察它是否有助于整体运行，而非仅凭季节便作吉凶判断。同样，水木增强的阶段可能提高表达、交易与资源流动的显著度，同时也会增加交付压力；土金较能发挥作用的阶段，则较有利于整理结构、补充能力与巩固留存。当前己巳大运、丙寅流年已提供，但完整序列、起运时间、年龄与公历年份映射未提供，不能指定何时发生这些变化，更不能据此断定某年得财或失财。能够成立的结论，是不同阶段会改变财富链条中“创造机会”与“承接成果”的相对重点，而最终质量仍取决于二者是否同步。",
+        "enManuscript": "Resources and wealth in this chart are not adequately described by counting Wealth stars or treating their presence as a promise of money. The decisive question is whether the established output-to-wealth pathway can be carried consistently. The prominence of Water gives knowledge, technique, judgment, communication, and problem-solving an outward-moving quality; Wood then receives that output as projects, transactions, client requirements, deliverables, or practical obligations. Indirect Wealth is visible on the month stem, while both Direct and Indirect Wealth also appear within the branches. Wealth therefore has an overt, opportunity-oriented side as well as a quieter side embedded in sustained arrangements and detailed responsibilities. This establishes a channel through which value may be monetized, but it does not determine the amount earned or guarantee that what is generated will be retained.\n\nIncome formation and wealth retention must be distinguished. An output-to-wealth structure can connect ideas and capabilities with external demand, yet greater output also brings more delivery, management, communication, and follow-through. Because the Day Master stands on the weaker side of balance, commercial activity can expand faster than the capacity required to support it. In practice, this may appear as an ability to identify openings, formulate an offer, and move an arrangement forward, followed by a need to absorb the less visible costs of quality control, time, maintenance, and completion. The structural requirement is not to suppress productive output, but to ensure that each outward commitment is backed by sufficient process, reserves, and execution.\n\nThe repeated Companion influence adds independence and a strong peer-level dimension to resource management. It can support self-directed action, but it can also work through partners, colleagues, or teams that pool capabilities. When roles are explicit, shared effort, review, and division of labor can increase carrying capacity. When authority, costs, returns, and accountability are left ambiguous, the same shared structure may disperse resources across too many people or priorities. Companion stars do not automatically signify competition or financial loss. Their result depends on whether cooperation is governed well enough to protect the productive pathway from overload.\n\nEarth Resource is the more important condition behind sustainable wealth. Its presence is mainly concealed in the branches rather than openly displayed, so support tends to operate in the background. Accumulated learning, professional frameworks, documentation, risk reserves, review procedures, and a workable recovery rhythm all belong to this layer. Because this backing is less visible, it can be easy to focus on front-end opportunities while underestimating the infrastructure needed to complete them. Earth as the primary useful element, with Metal as secondary support, places stabilization before further expansion: the actor and the operating base must be strong enough to carry the output and Wealth already in motion.\n\nUnder pressure, the characteristic distortion is to answer a carrying problem with still more proposals, explanation, activity, or commitment. Work volume may rise without a corresponding rise in completion; income may be produced while retention is reduced by reinvestment, coordination costs, or unfinished obligations. The flexibility of Indirect Wealth can become excessive expansion if Resource and Companion support are not active, while the efficiency-seeking side of Hurting Officer may move an arrangement into delivery before its foundations are ready. These are conditional tendencies, not predicted events. In the more integrated expression, value, price, scope, responsibility, and aftercare belong to the same agreement, so that completing what has been promised becomes part of wealth preservation rather than a separate burden.\n\nFire remains a climate-balancing candidate in the cold and damp seasonal background, but that role must not be silently merged with the useful elements identified through strength and structural analysis. Its appearance in a particular period would still need to be evaluated in context; Fire is not, by itself, a promise of greater wealth. Periods emphasizing Water and Wood may make communication, transactions, and resource movement more prominent while also increasing delivery demands. Periods in which Earth and Metal can function coherently may place more emphasis on consolidation, capability, and retention. The current Ji-Si Da Yun and Bing-Yin Annual layer are supplied; the complete sequence, starting date, age, and Gregorian mapping are missing, so no dated gain or loss can be assigned. Timing can only be described conditionally: different phases alter the balance between creating opportunity and carrying the result, and the quality of the outcome depends on whether those two functions remain aligned.",
