+        "zhHansManuscript": "关系与亲密模式中，财星不能被机械地等同于某一位配偶，也不能由其位置直接推断婚姻事实。这里更可靠的阅读，是观察一个人如何把表达、选择与现实责任连接起来。既有的伤官生财路径，使关系不只停留在感受或理念层面，而倾向于通过解决问题、落实安排、投入时间与资源来确认价值。偏财明透而正财暗藏，意味着互动既可能需要灵活回应当下情境，也需要照顾长期承诺、细节秩序与可持续性。关系是否顺畅，往往不只取决于心意是否存在，还取决于说出的内容能否转化为双方都能承受的安排。\n\n伤官带来较强的辨识、表达与修正功能，比肩则强调自主、平等和不愿完全依附于单一权威的倾向。二者结合时，较自然的关系方式是保留各自判断，同时通过坦白沟通建立合作。顺畅表达可以是直接说明需要、讨论现实限制、共同改进生活安排；它并不要求任何一方放弃独立性。若彼此能够把不同意见当作信息，伤官的敏锐可帮助发现问题，比肩的平等感也能维持相互尊重。反过来，如果表达只剩评判、解释或效率要求，关系便可能听见结论，却感受不到承接过程。\n\n申子辰三合水局与寅申冲同时存在，为关系结构增添了一个重要层次：一方面有把经验、信息与共同目标组织起来的能力，另一方面，系统内部仍保留修正、拉动与不同节奏。冲并没有取消三合，三合也没有消除冲，因此不能把这种并存简单翻译为必然争执、分离或迁移。放在亲密互动中，它更适合被理解为连续性与调整需求同时存在。关系可以追求整体配合，却仍需容纳某些不同步的部分；可以形成共同方向，却不能假设所有成员、角色或生活领域都会自然保持同一速度。\n\n日主的承载条件使亲密关系中的“付出”需要特别注意边界。伤官生财容易以行动、方案和实际承担表达重视，但当外部需求增加时，提供帮助与承担责任可能快于自身恢复。此时，隐藏负荷未必立即显现，可能先表现为持续协调、反复说明或试图独自把事情处理妥当。若双方只看见结果，没有看见支持结果所需的时间与资源，原本出于负责的投入便可能转为疲惫。这里并不能断言谁会过度付出，只能指出结构要求把能力范围、共同责任和完成标准说清楚，才不致让实际照顾变成无边界的消耗。\n\n比肩较多也使平等成为重要议题。平等运作良好时，双方各自有判断，又愿意共享信息、分担任务并接受复核；运作失衡时，则可能出现每个人都坚持自己的处理方式，或者表面共同承担，实际责任却无人完整承接。财星所代表的现实安排，需要从“愿意做什么”进一步落到“由谁完成、何时完成、完成到什么程度”。这种明确并非削弱亲密，反而能让承诺具有可依赖性。对于这一结构而言，可靠的关系不只是情绪浓度高，而是表达、资源与履约能够彼此对应。\n\n土印与金比劫构成较重要的制衡。印使关系中的表达不只追求即时反应，还能经过理解、沉淀与复盘；金则帮助主体保持清楚的立场和可执行边界。两者足够时，伤官的锋利可以转化为诚实而有建设性的沟通，财星的投入也较不容易变成无止境的责任扩张。调候所保留的火，只是冬令背景下的温暖候选，不能直接等同于情感热度，更不能单凭火的出现判断关系吉凶。\n\n具体时序会改变关系中哪一层更突出。水木增强时，交流、社交流动、现实安排与相互需求可能更受关注，同时也更考验承载和边界；土金能有效发挥时，重点可能转向稳定立场、厘清责任和修复支持基础。若火在适当条件下参与，它可能改善整体运行的温度与流通，但仍须结合全局判断。当前己巳大运、丙寅流年已有，但缺少完整序列、起运时间、年龄与公历年份映射，不能指定关系变化发生在何时，也不能推断订婚、结婚、分离或其他事件。能够确认的只是：时序不会改变结构中对“表达与承载并重”的要求，只会改变哪一项在某个阶段更需要被看见。",
+        "enManuscript": "In relationships and intimacy, Wealth cannot be mechanically equated with a particular spouse, nor can its placement establish facts about marriage. A more reliable interpretation concerns how expression and personal choice are connected with practical responsibility. The existing output-to-wealth pathway tends to validate a bond through problem-solving, workable arrangements, and the investment of time or resources, rather than leaving the relationship entirely at the level of feeling or intention. Visible Indirect Wealth supports responsiveness to changing circumstances, while concealed Direct Wealth adds an underlying concern with continuity, detail, and defined obligation. Relational ease therefore depends not only on whether care is present, but on whether what is expressed can become an arrangement that both people can carry.\n\nHurting Officer contributes discernment, articulation, and a wish to correct what is not working. The repeated Companion influence places autonomy, equality, and independent judgment alongside it. Their constructive combination favors candid cooperation: each person can retain a point of view while discussing needs, constraints, and possible improvements openly. When differences are treated as information, Hurting Officer can identify the actual issue and the Companion quality can preserve mutual standing. Under strain, however, communication may become dominated by conclusions, critique, explanation, or efficiency. The content may be accurate, yet the other person may experience little room for the process by which understanding is reached.\n\nThe coexistence of the Water Three Harmony and the Yin–Shen clash adds an important qualification. There is capacity to organize information, experience, and shared aims into a larger continuity, while an internal source of adjustment and divergent rhythm remains active. The clash does not cancel the harmony, and the harmony does not erase the clash. It would therefore be unsound to translate this configuration directly into quarrels, separation, relocation, or any other event. In intimate life, it is better understood as a simultaneous need for cohesion and revision: a relationship may develop a common direction without every role or area of life moving at the same speed.\n\nThe chart’s carrying condition makes boundaries around giving especially important. An output-to-wealth structure can express care by taking action, providing a solution, or assuming concrete responsibility. If external demands multiply, however, the promise to help may expand faster than the ability to recover. Hidden overload may first appear as constant coordination, repeated explanation, or an attempt to complete everything personally. When only the final result is visible, the time and support required to produce it can be overlooked. This does not prove that either party will overgive. It shows why capacity, shared responsibility, and standards of completion must be made explicit if practical care is not to become open-ended expenditure.\n\nThe strong peer-level emphasis also makes equality a central operating question. At its best, both parties preserve independent judgment while sharing information, dividing tasks, and allowing their assumptions to be checked. In a less balanced expression, each person may hold to a separate method, or responsibility may appear shared without anyone carrying it through to completion. The practical domain represented by Wealth needs to move beyond willingness into clarity about who will do what, by when, and to what standard. Such precision does not reduce intimacy; it makes commitment dependable. For this structure, a reliable bond is one in which expression, resources, and follow-through correspond.\n\nEarth Resource and Metal Companion provide the main balancing conditions. Resource introduces reflection, context, and the ability to digest experience before reacting. Metal helps maintain a clear standpoint and executable boundaries. When these functions are available, the sharpness of Hurting Officer can become honest, constructive communication, while the investment represented by Wealth is less likely to expand without limit. Fire remains only a climate-balancing candidate for the winter background. It must not be equated directly with emotional warmth or used by itself to judge relationship outcomes.\n\nTiming would change which part of this pattern becomes more prominent. Stronger Water and Wood phases could emphasize communication, social movement, practical arrangements, and mutual demands, while testing capacity and boundaries. Periods in which Earth and Metal function effectively may emphasize stabilization, clearer responsibility, and restoration of support. Fire may improve warmth and circulation under suitable conditions, but only in relation to the whole structure. Although the current Ji-Si Da Yun and Bing-Yin Annual layer are supplied, the full sequence, starting date, age, and Gregorian mapping are missing; no period can be assigned to commitment, marriage, separation, or any other event. The defensible conclusion is narrower: timing changes the emphasis, but it does not remove the underlying need to keep expression and carrying capacity together.",
