+        "zhHansManuscript": "长期周期的作用，不是替原局重新定义一个命运，而是在不同阶段改变哪些结构功能更容易被调用、哪些环节需要承担更大负荷。原局的基本路径保持不变，大运与流年所做的是调整其显著度、速度与承载条件。因此，判断转折时不能只看某一五行出现，也不能把一段大运直接等同于成功、阻碍或某类固定事件；真正需要观察的是，新增力量究竟补足了原有路径，还是令输出与兑现进一步超过日主所能稳定承受的范围。\n\n从长期功能看，土的阶段性加强较有利于建立承载层，使经验、知识和已经展开的事务能够形成制度、程序与可持续的基础。金的支持则更接近巩固主体性、执行连续性和边界感。两者的意义并不是让结构停下来，而是让原本活跃的输出具有保存、复核和延续的条件。若周期中土金得到适当体现，转折常首先发生在运作方式上：安排变得更可重复，责任边界更明确，资源不再只用于启动，也能用于维护。至于现实中会落在哪个领域，仍须结合具体生活资料，不能由命局单独指定。\n\n相对地，当某一阶段进一步强化流动、表达、目标展开或现实兑现时，原有路径可能更容易显现，但“更容易发动”并不等于“无条件更有利”。如果支持同步存在，活跃度可以转化为学习成果、解决方案和可落实的安排；如果支持不足，同样的活跃度便可能增加开放事项、协作成本和后续维护。长期周期中的关键差别，往往不是有没有机会启动，而是启动之后是否有能力保留成果，并为已经形成的安排负责。\n\n火在长期时序中的作用需要单独看待。它是冬令背景下的调候候选，可以带来温暖、启动与显化，但不能据此覆盖扶抑与格局层面对土金承载的优先判断。火性阶段若同时获得稳定支持，可能使行动更集中、节奏更清楚；若只形成催动而缺少承接，则容易把潜在能力迅速推向前台，却也同步放大时间压力和履行要求。因此，长期周期中的“转暖”与“变得更有利”不是同义词，仍须查看整体配合。\n\n地支关系会使某些转折呈现为结构重组，而不只是力量增减。原局中的三合与冲同时存在，所以后续大运、流年再次触及相关成员时，可能提高整合、流动、修正或牵动的显著度。这里的转折首先是命理结构中的重点移动，不能直接翻译为迁移、人际破裂或其他具体事件。合不必然意味着顺利，冲也不必然意味着损失；它们分别提示连接、重组、位移或修正的可能机制，实际表现仍取决于承载条件以及现实情境。\n\n由此看，较可靠的长期判断方式，是把每一阶段放回“输出—兑现—承载”的完整链条中。周期若补足后端，重点可以从不断启动转向沉淀、整合和持续；周期若加强前端，则需要更严格地核对时间、支持和责任容量；周期若同时引动多组关系，转折可能表现为旧安排需要重新协调，而不是简单的吉凶翻转。由于没有提供完整的大运序列、起运时间与对应年龄，本节不指定人生阶段，也不排列固定年份。可以确定的只是：长期变化会改变结构重点，却不会取消原局对承载与制衡的持续要求。",
+        "enManuscript": "Long-term cycles do not replace the natal structure with a new destiny. They alter which functions become easier to access, which ones move to the foreground, and where the greater burden must be carried. The natal pathway remains the foundation; luck pillars and annual influences change its emphasis, pace, and support conditions. A turning point therefore cannot be judged from the mere appearance of one element, nor should an entire cycle be labeled as success, obstruction, or a predetermined class of event. The essential question is whether the added influence completes the existing process or pushes production and practical commitment beyond what the structure can sustain consistently.\n\nPeriods that strengthen Earth can improve containment, allowing experience, knowledge, and ongoing matters to settle into systems, procedures, and durable foundations. Metal offers a different but related form of support through continuity, boundaries, and a firmer center of execution. Their purpose is not to stop movement. It is to give active output the means to be preserved, reviewed, and extended. When these forms of support are appropriately available, the first turning point may occur in the manner of operation itself: arrangements become repeatable, responsibility is better defined, and resources are used not only to initiate but also to maintain. Which area of life carries that change cannot be specified without corresponding real-world information.\n\nA cycle that further emphasizes movement, expression, expanded objectives, or practical realization may make the established productive pathway more visible. Easier activation, however, is not the same as unconditional benefit. With adequate support, increased activity can become learning, solutions, and workable arrangements. Without it, the same activity can multiply open commitments, coordination costs, and maintenance duties. The decisive long-term distinction is often not whether something can begin, but whether its results can be retained and the resulting obligations carried.\n\nFire must be treated as a separate timing layer. It remains a climate-regulating candidate in the cold seasonal setting and can contribute warmth, activation, and visibility, but it does not override the priority given to Earth and Metal in the support analysis. When Fire operates alongside stable containment, action may become more focused and momentum clearer. If it acts mainly as acceleration without support, latent capacity may be pushed rapidly into expression while time pressure and delivery demands rise with it. A warmer phase is therefore not automatically synonymous with a more favorable one; the full configuration still matters.\n\nBranch interactions can make some transitions resemble structural reorganization rather than a simple increase or decrease of elemental force. Because combination and clash coexist in the natal structure, later cycles that engage the same members can heighten themes of integration, flow, correction, or mutual displacement. This is first a shift of emphasis within the BaZi mechanism, not a direct forecast of relocation, broken relationships, or another concrete event. Combination does not guarantee ease, and clash does not guarantee loss. They describe possible mechanisms of connection, rearrangement, movement, and correction whose actual expression depends on carrying capacity and lived circumstances.\n\nThe most reliable way to read a long phase is therefore to examine the entire chain from output to realization to support. A cycle that strengthens the back end may shift emphasis from constant initiation toward consolidation and continuity. A cycle that intensifies the front end calls for closer attention to available time, shared support, and responsibility capacity. A cycle that activates several relationships at once may require existing arrangements to be renegotiated rather than producing a simple reversal from favorable to unfavorable. Since no complete sequence of luck pillars, starting date, or corresponding ages has been supplied, no fixed life stage or year can be assigned here. What can be stated is that long-term timing changes the center of gravity while leaving the natal need for containment and balance intact.",
