+        "en": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "This is not, however, a case of complete elemental transformation.",
+                "start": 290,
+                "end": 356,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The original hidden stems and structural meanings of Shen and Chen remain active, while the Yin–Shen clash continues to modify members of the Water configuration.",
+                "start": 357,
+                "end": 519,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The chart therefore should not be reduced to an undifferentiated mass of Water.",
+                "start": 520,
+                "end": 599,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The Day Master is assessed as balanced but leaning weak.",
+                "start": 750,
+                "end": 806,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Considerable personal energy is therefore directed into observing, evaluating, explaining, and producing tangible results.",
+                "start": 1110,
+                "end": 1232,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The resulting character is neither simply forceful nor passive: judgment can be clear and reactions quick, while sustained high-quality performance still depends on a stable internal and practical foundation.",
+                "start": 1490,
+                "end": 1698,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Its central capability lies not merely in possessing knowledge, but in turning understanding into something usable, exchangeable, and measurable.",
+                "start": 1796,
+                "end": 1941,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "This is a structural tendency, not evidence of a predetermined occupation, educational history, or level of achievement.",
+                "start": 2525,
+                "end": 2645,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The prominence of Geng Metal and Companion stars gives expression a strong sense of boundaries and standards.",
+                "start": 2647,
+                "end": 2756,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "When circumstances are vague, inefficient, or internally inconsistent, there is often less willingness to preserve superficial harmony by leaving the problem untouched.",
+                "start": 2757,
+                "end": 2925,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Fire in appropriate measure can represent warmth, activation, clear expectations, and a workable pace, preventing analysis from becoming too cool or detached.",
+                "start": 5991,
+                "end": 6149,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              }
+            ],
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "The natural impulse is to distinguish, correct, and move matters forward.",
+                "start": 2926,
+                "end": 2999,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "At its best, this protects quality and allows an independent position to be maintained among peers.",
+                "start": 3000,
+                "end": 3099,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Companion energy does not mean competition alone; it also shows that capacity can be increased through colleagues, professional equals, and genuinely shared responsibility.",
+                "start": 3100,
+                "end": 3272,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The coexistence of the Yin–Shen clash and the Three Harmony configuration adds an important dynamic quality.",
+                "start": 3672,
+                "end": 3780,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "On one side, ideas and information can converge rapidly around a problem and develop into sustained analysis or production.",
+                "start": 3781,
+                "end": 3904,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "On the other, the internal process does not remain fixed on one track; there is a recurring force of recalibration, a change of angle, or a challenge to the first solution.",
+                "start": 3905,
+                "end": 4077,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "When this operates smoothly, concentration and correction coexist: a proposal can be formed, and its blind spots can also be detected.",
+                "start": 4078,
+                "end": 4212,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Under pressure, the same mechanism may become too many simultaneous lines of thought and responsibility, with one conclusion entering revision as soon as it has been reached.",
+                "start": 4213,
+                "end": 4387,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Output can then move faster than assimilation and recovery.",
+                "start": 4388,
+                "end": 4447,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The clash should not be translated directly into a guaranteed interpersonal conflict, relocation, or external event.",
+                "start": 4448,
+                "end": 4564,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Its first meaning here is the coexistence of movement and structural correction.",
+                "start": 4565,
+                "end": 4645,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Earth allows information to be absorbed, organized, and converted into reusable experience.",
+                "start": 5051,
+                "end": 5142,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "From the separate perspective of seasonal regulation, Fire remains a possible source of warmth in the cold and damp winter setting.",
+                "start": 5690,
+                "end": 5821,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              }
+            ]
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [
+            {
+              "text": "The Shen–Zi–Chen Three Harmony Water configuration is established, giving unusual structural prominence to expression, production, circulation, and the conversion of thought into results.",
+              "start": 102,
+              "end": 289,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "In ordinary life, this may appear as an ability to isolate the key issue quickly, reorganize complicated material into a coherent proposal, or translate abstract knowledge into a product, method, explanation, or decision framework that others can apply.",
+              "start": 2271,
+              "end": 2524,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "It is a layered structure in which output is concentrated, underlying support remains present, and part of the system is continually being adjusted.",
+              "start": 600,
+              "end": 748,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PASS",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "MECHANISM",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+            "BOUNDARY"
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "sectionId": "S03",
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "人生结构与运行方式",
+          "en": "Life Structure and Operating Patterns"
+        },
+        "titleTrace": {
+          "owner": "BAZI_SECTION_PURPOSE",
+          "sectionId": "S03",
+          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3"
+        },
+        "zh-Hans": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [],
+            []
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PUBLICATION_REPAIR",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "MECHANISM"
+          ]
+        },
+        "en": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "Faced with a new problem, the tendency is not necessarily to wait until every condition is settled before responding; the answer may already be taking shape while the issue is still being understood.",
+                "start": 247,
+                "end": 446,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Material can be processed while its improvable, exchangeable, or implementable features are being identified.",
+                "start": 515,
+                "end": 624,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Yet the overall rhythm can also become governed by a continuing demand to produce results.",
+                "start": 625,
+                "end": 715,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Effectiveness carries particular weight.",
+                "start": 904,
+                "end": 944,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Knowledge that has not entered practice can feel incomplete, while expression that does not improve a decision, advance a process, or produce a usable delivery may seem insufficient.",
+                "start": 945,
+                "end": 1127,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Outsiders may notice the speed of the result and underestimate the preparation beneath it.",
+                "start": 1435,
+                "end": 1525,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "If that hidden layer is also neglected internally, taking on more volume may be mistaken for developing greater ability, when it may actually reduce stability in the next cycle.",
+                "start": 1526,
+                "end": 1703,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Responsibility follows the same principle.",
+                "start": 1705,
+                "end": 1747,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "A defined obligation with clear limits and a genuine point of completion can mobilize judgment and execution.",
+                "start": 1748,
+                "end": 1857,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The arrangement may look complete from the outside even though the carrying burden has not truly been distributed.",
+                "start": 2380,
+                "end": 2494,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The convergence of the Three Harmony configuration and the corrective action of the clash gives life a recurring pattern of formation, revision, and renewed formation.",
+                "start": 2496,
+                "end": 2663,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The difficulty is not necessarily an inability to decide.",
+                "start": 3128,
+                "end": 3185,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Its effect depends on whether the Earth and Metal foundation can carry it.",
+                "start": 6188,
+                "end": 6262,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              }
+            ],
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "Plans can gather around a central objective, but they rarely become immune to change merely because an initial shape has been reached.",
+                "start": 2664,
+                "end": 2798,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "When unbalanced, optimization may continue before the existing plan has been adequately implemented, or effort may be spread because several viable directions are visible at once.",
+                "start": 2948,
+                "end": 3127,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Rather, each decision can reveal another layer that appears to require immediate handling.",
+                "start": 3186,
+                "end": 3276,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Producing a result and retaining its benefits are nevertheless separate stages.",
+                "start": 3696,
+                "end": 3775,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "When Earth and Metal functions are adequately represented, experience can be turned into process, ability can acquire boundaries, and what is gained is more readily converted into a stable base.",
+                "start": 3943,
+                "end": 4137,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "When carrying capacity is insufficient, business or responsibility may grow without a corresponding increase in discretionary time and energy.",
+                "start": 4138,
+                "end": 4280,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Development should therefore be measured not only by what comes in, but by what remains: methods, credibility, tools, available time, and capacity that can still be used in the next cycle.",
+                "start": 4281,
+                "end": 4469,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "When an undertaking is clearly defined and fulfilled according to its conditions, output has a destination and ability receives concrete feedback.",
+                "start": 4555,
+                "end": 4701,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Smooth functioning does not mean answering every request immediately.",
+                "start": 4927,
+                "end": 4996,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Timing changes which part of the structure becomes prominent; the current Ji-Si Da Yun and Bing-Yin Annual layer are supplied, but the full sequence, starting date, age, and Gregorian mapping are not, so no dated event can be assigned.",
+                "start": 5200,
+                "end": 5435,
+                "role": "TIMING",
+                "roles": [
+                  "TIMING",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Its central requirement is that every expansion be matched by adequate support.",
+                "start": 6538,
+                "end": 6617,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 7
+              }
+            ]
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [
+            {
+              "text": "This sequence can begin quickly.",
+              "start": 214,
+              "end": 246,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The advantage is a short distance between learning and application.",
+              "start": 447,
+              "end": 514,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The main operating sequence of this life structure is to receive and distinguish information, formulate an explanation or solution, and then direct that output toward resources, results, or practical arrangements.",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 213,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PASS",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+            "MECHANISM",
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "TIMING"
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "sectionId": "S04",
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "事业发展与职业方向",
+          "en": "Career Development and Direction"
+        },
+        "titleTrace": {
+          "owner": "BAZI_SECTION_PURPOSE",
+          "sectionId": "S04",
+          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3"
+        },
+        "zh-Hans": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [],
+            []
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PUBLICATION_REPAIR",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "MECHANISM"
+          ]
+        },
+        "en": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "The material is not entirely standardized, judgment is required, and the final result must be usable by someone else or capable of informing a real decision.",
+                "start": 300,
+                "end": 457,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "At the opposite extreme, unrestricted expression without a delivery standard allows the process to stop at opinion rather than becoming durable professional value.",
+                "start": 583,
+                "end": 746,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Relevant career capacity may therefore gather around functions such as analysis, planning, research, product development, technical translation, consulting, process improvement, commercial judgment, and the applied use of content or knowledge.",
+                "start": 748,
+                "end": 991,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "These are functional examples, not destined occupations.",
+                "start": 992,
+                "end": 1048,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "In a technical setting, the pattern may appear as turning specialized detail into an executable solution.",
+                "start": 1049,
+                "end": 1154,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Whether any of these becomes an actual profession depends on education, experience, opportunity, and environment.",
+                "start": 1447,
+                "end": 1560,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "An environment that relies on vague authority while refusing evidence or constructive improvement may be difficult to inhabit over the long term.",
+                "start": 1800,
+                "end": 1945,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Organizations with clear objectives, discussable responsibilities, and a genuine place for professional input are more likely to make constructive use of this structure.",
+                "start": 1946,
+                "end": 2115,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Bing Fire Seven Killings is hidden within Yin, rather than dominant in a visible stem; it points to formal responsibility, standards, deadlines, and delivery consequences, while Hurting Officer generating Wealth concerns usable output.",
+                "start": 2682,
+                "end": 2917,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The hidden Resource function is critical here.",
+                "start": 3658,
+                "end": 3704,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Job title by itself is not a measure of career quality.",
+                "start": 6385,
+                "end": 6440,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 8
+              }
+            ],
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "Autonomy does not mean that self-employment is required.",
+                "start": 2116,
+                "end": 2172,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "It can also mean holding a clearly defined field of expertise within an organization, taking responsibility for method and quality, and collaborating with colleagues of comparable competence.",
+                "start": 2173,
+                "end": 2364,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Back-end process, resource allocation, and delivery capability must grow alongside front-end opportunity.",
+                "start": 2575,
+                "end": 2680,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Corrective judgment and Seven Killings pressure are distinct: proposing an improvement does not confer authority; Indirect Resource training and process, with Companion collaboration, provide the support needed to carry standards and deadlines.",
+                "start": 2919,
+                "end": 3163,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The professional advantage of the generating pathway is the conversion of knowledge and expression into customer, product, or decision value.",
+                "start": 3165,
+                "end": 3306,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "It is not limited to speaking or writing.",
+                "start": 3307,
+                "end": 3348,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Analysis, design, technology, systems, and methods can all make an operation more effective.",
+                "start": 3349,
+                "end": 3441,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Mature career strength is usually not a series of clever one-time responses, but the organization of successful experience into repeatable process, so that personal judgment becomes dependable professional capacity.",
+                "start": 3442,
+                "end": 3657,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Research, training, review, and knowledge management may not produce immediate visible revenue, but they determine whether output retains depth.",
+                "start": 3705,
+                "end": 3849,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "If career development pursues only immediate delivery, activity may remain high while the renewal of expertise gradually falls behind the growth of obligations.",
+                "start": 3850,
+                "end": 4010,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "In the short term, this can preserve results.",
+                "start": 4557,
+                "end": 4602,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "This is more than administrative tidiness.",
+                "start": 5414,
+                "end": 5456,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 7
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The current Ji-Si Da Yun and Bing-Yin Annual layer are supplied for structural interpretation.",
+                "start": 6606,
+                "end": 6700,
+                "role": "TIMING",
+                "roles": [
+                  "TIMING",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 9
+              }
+            ]
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [
+            {
+              "text": "The most suitable environments generally contain a meaningful degree of complexity.",
+              "start": 216,
+              "end": 299,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Career development is less about selecting one predetermined industry than about finding work in which the sequence of identifying a problem, formulating a response, and creating practical value can operate in full.",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 215,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "In a commercial setting, it may involve identifying demand, designing delivery, or improving resource allocation.",
+              "start": 1155,
+              "end": 1268,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            }
+          ],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PASS",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "MECHANISM",
+            "TIMING"
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "sectionId": "S05",
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "资源与财富",
+          "en": "Resources and Wealth"
+        },
+        "titleTrace": {
+          "owner": "BAZI_SECTION_PURPOSE",
+          "sectionId": "S05",
+          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3"
+        },
+        "zh-Hans": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [],
+            []
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PUBLICATION_REPAIR",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+            "MECHANISM",
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+          ]
+        },
+        "en": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "This establishes a channel through which value may be monetized, but it does not determine the amount earned or guarantee that what is generated will be retained.",
+                "start": 751,
+                "end": 913,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The structural requirement is not to suppress productive output, but to ensure that each outward commitment is backed by sufficient process, reserves, and execution.",
+                "start": 1522,
+                "end": 1687,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "It can support self-directed action, but it can also work through partners, colleagues, or teams that pool capabilities.",
+                "start": 1798,
+                "end": 1918,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "When roles are explicit, shared effort, review, and division of labor can increase carrying capacity.",
+                "start": 1919,
+                "end": 2020,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Companion stars do not automatically signify competition or financial loss.",
+                "start": 2179,
+                "end": 2254,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Their result depends on whether cooperation is governed well enough to protect the productive pathway from overload.",
+                "start": 2255,
+                "end": 2371,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Because this backing is less visible, it can be easy to focus on front-end opportunities while underestimating the infrastructure needed to complete them.",
+                "start": 2726,
+                "end": 2880,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Under pressure, the characteristic distortion is to answer a carrying problem with still more proposals, explanation, activity, or commitment.",
+                "start": 3104,
+                "end": 3246,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "These are conditional tendencies, not predicted events.",
+                "start": 3667,
+                "end": 3722,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Periods in which Earth and Metal can function coherently may place more emphasis on consolidation, capability, and retention.",
+                "start": 4440,
+                "end": 4565,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              }
+            ],
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "The decisive question is whether the established output-to-wealth pathway can be carried consistently.",
+                "start": 139,
+                "end": 241,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Indirect Wealth is visible on the month stem, while both Direct and Indirect Wealth also appear within the branches.",
+                "start": 485,
+                "end": 601,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Wealth therefore has an overt, opportunity-oriented side as well as a quieter side embedded in sustained arrangements and detailed responsibilities.",
+                "start": 602,
+                "end": 750,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "An output-to-wealth structure can connect ideas and capabilities with external demand, yet greater output also brings more delivery, management, communication, and follow-through.",
+                "start": 976,
+                "end": 1155,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "In practice, this may appear as an ability to identify openings, formulate an offer, and move an arrangement forward, followed by a need to absorb the less visible costs of quality control, time, maintenance, and completion.",
+                "start": 1297,
+                "end": 1521,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Earth Resource is the more important condition behind sustainable wealth.",
+                "start": 2373,
+                "end": 2446,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Fire remains a climate-balancing candidate in the cold and damp seasonal background, but that role must not be silently merged with the useful elements identified through strength and structural analysis.",
+                "start": 3949,
+                "end": 4153,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Its appearance in a particular period would still need to be evaluated in context; Fire is not, by itself, a promise of greater wealth.",
+                "start": 4154,
+                "end": 4289,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The current Ji-Si Da Yun and Bing-Yin Annual layer are supplied; the complete sequence, starting date, age, and Gregorian mapping are missing, so no dated gain or loss can be assigned.",
+                "start": 4566,
+                "end": 4750,
+                "role": "TIMING",
+                "roles": [
+                  "TIMING",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Timing can only be described conditionally: different phases alter the balance between creating opportunity and carrying the result, and the quality of the outcome depends on whether those two functions remain aligned.",
+                "start": 4751,
+                "end": 4969,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              }
+            ]
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [
+            {
+              "text": "The prominence of Water gives knowledge, technique, judgment, communication, and problem-solving an outward-moving quality; Wood then receives that output as projects, transactions, client requirements, deliverables, or practical obligations.",
+              "start": 242,
+              "end": 484,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Income formation and wealth retention must be distinguished.",
+              "start": 915,
+              "end": 975,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Resources and wealth in this chart are not adequately described by counting Wealth stars or treating their presence as a promise of money.",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 138,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PASS",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "MECHANISM",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+            "TIMING"
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "sectionId": "S06",
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "关系与亲密模式",
+          "en": "Relationships and Intimacy"
+        },
+        "titleTrace": {
+          "owner": "BAZI_SECTION_PURPOSE",
+          "sectionId": "S06",
+          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3"
+        },
+        "zh-Hans": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [],
+            []
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PUBLICATION_REPAIR",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "MECHANISM",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+          ]
+        },
+        "en": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "Relational ease therefore depends not only on whether care is present, but on whether what is expressed can become an arrangement that both people can carry.",
+                "start": 686,
+                "end": 843,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The repeated Companion influence places autonomy, equality, and independent judgment alongside it.",
+                "start": 943,
+                "end": 1041,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Their constructive combination favors candid cooperation: each person can retain a point of view while discussing needs, constraints, and possible improvements openly.",
+                "start": 1042,
+                "end": 1209,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Under strain, however, communication may become dominated by conclusions, critique, explanation, or efficiency.",
+                "start": 1357,
+                "end": 1468,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The content may be accurate, yet the other person may experience little room for the process by which understanding is reached.",
+                "start": 1469,
+                "end": 1596,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The coexistence of the Water Three Harmony and the Yin–Shen clash adds an important qualification.",
+                "start": 1598,
+                "end": 1696,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "There is capacity to organize information, experience, and shared aims into a larger continuity, while an internal source of adjustment and divergent rhythm remains active.",
+                "start": 1697,
+                "end": 1869,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The clash does not cancel the harmony, and the harmony does not erase the clash.",
+                "start": 1870,
+                "end": 1950,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "It would therefore be unsound to translate this configuration directly into quarrels, separation, relocation, or any other event.",
+                "start": 1951,
+                "end": 2080,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The chart’s carrying condition makes boundaries around giving especially important.",
+                "start": 2281,
+                "end": 2364,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The strong peer-level emphasis also makes equality a central operating question.",
+                "start": 3036,
+                "end": 3116,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Such precision does not reduce intimacy; it makes commitment dependable.",
+                "start": 3566,
+                "end": 3638,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Metal helps maintain a clear standpoint and executable boundaries.",
+                "start": 3915,
+                "end": 3981,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              }
+            ],
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "In intimate life, it is better understood as a simultaneous need for cohesion and revision: a relationship may develop a common direction without every role or area of life moving at the same speed.",
+                "start": 2081,
+                "end": 2279,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Hidden overload may first appear as constant coordination, repeated explanation, or an attempt to complete everything personally.",
+                "start": 2595,
+                "end": 2724,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "This does not prove that either party will overgive.",
+                "start": 2827,
+                "end": 2879,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "It shows why capacity, shared responsibility, and standards of completion must be made explicit if practical care is not to become open-ended expenditure.",
+                "start": 2880,
+                "end": 3034,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "At its best, both parties preserve independent judgment while sharing information, dividing tasks, and allowing their assumptions to be checked.",
+                "start": 3117,
+                "end": 3261,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "In a less balanced expression, each person may hold to a separate method, or responsibility may appear shared without anyone carrying it through to completion.",
+                "start": 3262,
+                "end": 3421,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Earth Resource and Metal Companion provide the main balancing conditions.",
+                "start": 3746,
+                "end": 3819,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Fire remains only a climate-balancing candidate for the winter background.",
+                "start": 4181,
+                "end": 4255,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "It must not be equated directly with emotional warmth or used by itself to judge relationship outcomes.",
+                "start": 4256,
+                "end": 4359,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Timing would change which part of this pattern becomes more prominent.",
+                "start": 4361,
+                "end": 4431,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Stronger Water and Wood phases could emphasize communication, social movement, practical arrangements, and mutual demands, while testing capacity and boundaries.",
+                "start": 4432,
+                "end": 4593,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Although the current Ji-Si Da Yun and Bing-Yin Annual layer are supplied, the full sequence, starting date, age, and Gregorian mapping are missing; no period can be assigned to commitment, marriage, separation, or any other event.",
+                "start": 4841,
+                "end": 5071,
+                "role": "TIMING",
+                "roles": [
+                  "TIMING",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              }
+            ]
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [
+            {
+              "text": "A more reliable interpretation concerns how expression and personal choice are connected with practical responsibility.",
+              "start": 149,
+              "end": 268,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Hurting Officer contributes discernment, articulation, and a wish to correct what is not working.",
+              "start": 845,
+              "end": 942,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The existing output-to-wealth pathway tends to validate a bond through problem-solving, workable arrangements, and the investment of time or resources, rather than leaving the relationship entirely at the level of feeling or intention.",
+              "start": 269,
+              "end": 504,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PASS",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+            "MECHANISM",
+            "TIMING"
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "sectionId": "S07",
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "家庭与支持系统",
+          "en": "Family and Support"
+        },
+        "titleTrace": {
+          "owner": "BAZI_SECTION_PURPOSE",
+          "sectionId": "S07",
+          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3"
+        },
+        "zh-Hans": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [],
+            []
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PUBLICATION_REPAIR",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+          ]
+        },
+        "en": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "The first is easy to recognize as someone helping with a task; the second often becomes apparent only because the whole arrangement continues to function.",
+                "start": 715,
+                "end": 869,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "This does not establish how much help an actual family has provided.",
+                "start": 871,
+                "end": 939,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "It shows instead that carrying capacity is structurally distributed rather than derived from one source.",
+                "start": 940,
+                "end": 1044,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "It can reside in a reusable method, reliable information, retained experience, material reserves, or permission to pause and review.",
+                "start": 1252,
+                "end": 1384,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Some channels may be suited to continuity, while others introduce a different method, pace, or priority.",
+                "start": 1927,
+                "end": 2031,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "It indicates that cohesion depends on coordinating differences rather than assuming that no differences exist.",
+                "start": 2094,
+                "end": 2204,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "A Companion-based support style values equality and shared responsibility.",
+                "start": 2206,
+                "end": 2280,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Its strength is that pressure need not be placed entirely on one authority figure or caretaker; peer-level capacity can be mobilized when demands rise.",
+                "start": 2281,
+                "end": 2432,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Its weakness appears when everyone assumes that someone else can handle the matter, or when many people contribute without a common definition of completion.",
+                "start": 2433,
+                "end": 2590,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The aim is not to make one person carry more, but to ensure that help reaches a specific need and that all parties know when the responsibility has actually been fulfilled.",
+                "start": 2779,
+                "end": 2951,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "If these functions remain unrecognized, the person performing them may continue to look capable while gradually losing internal margin.",
+                "start": 3224,
+                "end": 3359,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Metal adds clearer personal boundaries, responsibility, and decision authority.",
+                "start": 3958,
+                "end": 4037,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              }
+            ],
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "Companion influence is conspicuous in the stems and has a branch root, whereas Indirect Resource is distributed through several branches but remains concealed.",
+                "start": 270,
+                "end": 429,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Support therefore has two distinct modes.",
+                "start": 430,
+                "end": 471,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Companion support can respond to immediate demands through division of labor and mutual reinforcement.",
+                "start": 1045,
+                "end": 1147,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Concealed Resource develops more slowly and may not arrive as overt reassurance or declared assistance.",
+                "start": 1148,
+                "end": 1251,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "If only visible action is counted as support, the less noticeable conditions that preserve long-term stability may be missed.",
+                "start": 1385,
+                "end": 1510,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Because both remain operative, the network can hold together without every component moving in the same direction.",
+                "start": 1718,
+                "end": 1832,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "This does not prove family conflict, distance, or separation.",
+                "start": 2032,
+                "end": 2093,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Otherwise, an apparently abundant network can create a second workload consisting of coordination itself.",
+                "start": 2673,
+                "end": 2778,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Different people can contribute within defined limits while retaining their own capacity.",
+                "start": 4157,
+                "end": 4246,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Communication, movement, and practical demands associated with Water and Wood may continue, but they are less likely to turn the system into one that only gives out and never replenishes itself.",
+                "start": 4247,
+                "end": 4441,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Periods in which Earth and Metal operate effectively may emphasize reserves, structure, and clearer responsibility.",
+                "start": 4833,
+                "end": 4948,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "No year can therefore be assigned to receiving help, leaving home, forming a household, or experiencing a change involving relatives.",
+                "start": 5062,
+                "end": 5195,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S07",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              }
+            ]
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [
+            {
+              "text": "The other is quieter and infrastructural, taking the form of knowledge, precedent, rules, logistics, and continuity.",
+              "start": 598,
+              "end": 714,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "One is visible and lateral, operating through shared effort, practical cooperation, and people working alongside one another.",
+              "start": 472,
+              "end": 597,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The sounder question is how support enters the structure and in what form it becomes usable.",
+              "start": 177,
+              "end": 269,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PASS",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "sectionId": "S08",
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "压力与脆弱点",
+          "en": "Pressure and Vulnerability"
+        },
+        "titleTrace": {
+          "owner": "BAZI_SECTION_PURPOSE",
+          "sectionId": "S08",
+          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3"
+        },
+        "zh-Hans": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [],
+            []
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PUBLICATION_REPAIR",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "MECHANISM",
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+          ]
+        },
+        "en": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "The established pathway naturally carries ideas toward articulation, problem-solving, tangible output, and real-world application.",
+                "start": 184,
+                "end": 314,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "When functioning smoothly, this structure can identify problems, organize complex information, and convert thought into usable outcomes.",
+                "start": 720,
+                "end": 856,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The Water configuration gives the output system considerable prominence, while the simultaneous Yin–Shen clash preserves an internal force of adjustment.",
+                "start": 857,
+                "end": 1010,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Progress is therefore not necessarily linear: continuity may coexist with changing conditions, competing requirements, or repeated course correction.",
+                "start": 1011,
+                "end": 1160,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Neither the combination nor the clash cancels the other, and their coexistence should not be translated into a predetermined conflict or event.",
+                "start": 1161,
+                "end": 1304,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "It describes a dynamic operating environment in which sustained flow and local correction are both necessary.",
+                "start": 1305,
+                "end": 1414,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "With adequate carrying capacity, this can become an alert, flexible, and result-conscious mode of functioning.",
+                "start": 1416,
+                "end": 1526,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Metal provides secondary reinforcement through steadiness, boundaries, and the ability to continue.",
+                "start": 1646,
+                "end": 1745,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Under heavier pressure, distortion is more likely to appear as a strong front end with an underdeveloped back end.",
+                "start": 2050,
+                "end": 2164,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "These are not fixed behavioral predictions.",
+                "start": 2505,
+                "end": 2548,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Hidden load is particularly important here.",
+                "start": 2681,
+                "end": 2724,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "More Fire is not automatically better.",
+                "start": 3541,
+                "end": 3579,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              }
+            ],
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "Yet with the Day Master on the balanced-but-lean-weak side, every additional layer of production, responsibility, or resource coordination also draws upon the capacity that must sustain it.",
+                "start": 315,
+                "end": 504,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The important question is therefore not merely whether something can be done, but whether enough support remains for revision, maintenance, and continuing accountability after the initial result has been produced.",
+                "start": 505,
+                "end": 718,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Earth, as the primary source of support and containment, helps turn output into method, order, and repeatable process.",
+                "start": 1527,
+                "end": 1645,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Under these conditions, expression serves completion rather than merely releasing immediate pressure, and resources can be retained, organized, and reused instead of only activated.",
+                "start": 1746,
+                "end": 1927,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "They are the more plausible failure modes when output and practical demands expand faster than the structure that must carry them.",
+                "start": 2549,
+                "end": 2679,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The resulting vulnerability is not a simple lack of ability; it is the prolonged use of ability for delivery without sufficient replenishment.",
+                "start": 3174,
+                "end": 3316,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Against the cold and damp seasonal background, Fire remains a climate-regulating candidate associated with warmth, activation, and animation.",
+                "start": 3318,
+                "end": 3459,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "It must not, however, be silently merged with the Earth-and-Metal support logic.",
+                "start": 3460,
+                "end": 3540,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Acceleration without sufficient containment can increase the burden on an already active output system.",
+                "start": 3580,
+                "end": 3683,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "That is what allows the chart’s productive pathway not only to begin, but also to remain sustainable.",
+                "start": 4025,
+                "end": 4126,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S08",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              }
+            ]
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [
+            {
+              "text": "The principal vulnerability in this chart is not simply the volume of external demands.",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 87,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The structure therefore has access to learning, synthesis, accumulated experience, and framework-building, but those functions require protected time and space.",
+              "start": 2833,
+              "end": 2993,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "It lies in whether expression, practical delivery, and structural support remain proportionate.",
+              "start": 88,
+              "end": 183,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PASS",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "sectionId": "S09",
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "长期周期与转折模式",
+          "en": "Long-Term Cycles and Turning Points"
+        },
+        "titleTrace": {
+          "owner": "BAZI_SECTION_PURPOSE",
+          "sectionId": "S09",
+          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3"
+        },
+        "zh-Hans": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [],
+            []
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PUBLICATION_REPAIR",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "TIMING",
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+          ]
+        },
+        "en": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "They alter which functions become easier to access, which ones move to the foreground, and where the greater burden must be carried.",
+                "start": 72,
+                "end": 204,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The essential question is whether the added influence completes the existing process or pushes production and practical commitment beyond what the structure can sustain consistently.",
+                "start": 515,
+                "end": 697,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Periods that strengthen Earth can improve containment, allowing experience, knowledge, and ongoing matters to settle into systems, procedures, and durable foundations.",
+                "start": 699,
+                "end": 866,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Their purpose is not to stop movement.",
+                "start": 986,
+                "end": 1024,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "It is to give active output the means to be preserved, reviewed, and extended.",
+                "start": 1025,
+                "end": 1103,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "A cycle that further emphasizes movement, expression, expanded objectives, or practical realization may make the established productive pathway more visible.",
+                "start": 1468,
+                "end": 1625,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Easier activation, however, is not the same as unconditional benefit.",
+                "start": 1626,
+                "end": 1695,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "With adequate support, increased activity can become learning, solutions, and workable arrangements.",
+                "start": 1696,
+                "end": 1796,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The decisive long-term distinction is often not whether something can begin, but whether its results can be retained and the resulting obligations carried.",
+                "start": 1902,
+                "end": 2057,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Fire must be treated as a separate timing layer.",
+                "start": 2059,
+                "end": 2107,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "When Fire operates alongside stable containment, action may become more focused and momentum clearer.",
+                "start": 2322,
+                "end": 2423,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "A warmer phase is therefore not automatically synonymous with a more favorable one; the full configuration still matters.",
+                "start": 2584,
+                "end": 2705,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Branch interactions can make some transitions resemble structural reorganization rather than a simple increase or decrease of elemental force.",
+                "start": 2707,
+                "end": 2849,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              }
+            ],
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "The natal pathway remains the foundation; luck pillars and annual influences change its emphasis, pace, and support conditions.",
+                "start": 205,
+                "end": 332,
+                "role": "TIMING",
+                "roles": [
+                  "TIMING",
+                  "MECHANISM",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Which area of life carries that change cannot be specified without corresponding real-world information.",
+                "start": 1362,
+                "end": 1466,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Because combination and clash coexist in the natal structure, later cycles that engage the same members can heighten themes of integration, flow, correction, or mutual displacement.",
+                "start": 2850,
+                "end": 3031,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "This is first a shift of emphasis within the BaZi mechanism, not a direct forecast of relocation, broken relationships, or another concrete event.",
+                "start": 3032,
+                "end": 3178,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Combination does not guarantee ease, and clash does not guarantee loss.",
+                "start": 3179,
+                "end": 3250,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "They describe possible mechanisms of connection, rearrangement, movement, and correction whose actual expression depends on carrying capacity and lived circumstances.",
+                "start": 3251,
+                "end": 3417,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The most reliable way to read a long phase is therefore to examine the entire chain from output to realization to support.",
+                "start": 3419,
+                "end": 3541,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "A cycle that strengthens the back end may shift emphasis from constant initiation toward consolidation and continuity.",
+                "start": 3542,
+                "end": 3660,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "A cycle that activates several relationships at once may require existing arrangements to be renegotiated rather than producing a simple reversal from favorable to unfavorable.",
+                "start": 3791,
+                "end": 3967,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "What can be stated is that long-term timing changes the center of gravity while leaving the natal need for containment and balance intact.",
+                "start": 4118,
+                "end": 4256,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S09",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              }
+            ]
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [
+            {
+              "text": "Long-term cycles do not replace the natal structure with a new destiny.",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 71,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Without it, the same activity can multiply open commitments, coordination costs, and maintenance duties.",
+              "start": 1797,
+              "end": 1901,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Metal offers a different but related form of support through continuity, boundaries, and a firmer center of execution.",
+              "start": 867,
+              "end": 985,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            }
+          ],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PASS",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "TIMING",
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "sectionId": "S10",
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "当前时序",
+          "en": "Current Timing"
+        },
+        "titleTrace": {
+          "owner": "BAZI_SECTION_PURPOSE",
+          "sectionId": "S10",
+          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3"
+        },
+        "zh-Hans": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [],
+            []
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PUBLICATION_REPAIR",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "TIMING",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+          ]
+        },
+        "en": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "The supplied current timing is a Ji-Si luck pillar with a Bing-Yin annual influence.",
+                "start": 0,
+                "end": 84,
+                "role": "TIMING",
+                "roles": [
+                  "TIMING",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Ji Earth at the luck-pillar stem corresponds in principle with the chart’s need for containment, but it forms a Jia–Ji combination with the natal month stem.",
+                "start": 562,
+                "end": 719,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Combination establishes connection and mutual involvement; it does not by itself establish elemental transformation, and no transformation conclusion has been supplied.",
+                "start": 720,
+                "end": 888,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "A more precise reading is that organization, stabilization, and carrying capacity move to the foreground while becoming intertwined with the chart’s existing route toward practical realization.",
+                "start": 994,
+                "end": 1187,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Si introduces Fire and therefore carries a climate-regulating implication within the cold natal setting.",
+                "start": 1408,
+                "end": 1512,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Yet its role is not limited to warmth.",
+                "start": 1513,
+                "end": 1551,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "It forms both a combination and a break with the natal Shen, a harm with the natal Yin, and participates in the Yin–Si–Shen punishment.",
+                "start": 1552,
+                "end": 1687,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Combination, break, harm, and punishment thus coexist, indicating connection, readjustment, indirect strain, and structural friction at the same time.",
+                "start": 1688,
+                "end": 1838,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The Bing-Yin annual influence further heightens the visibility of Fire and Yin.",
+                "start": 2100,
+                "end": 2179,
+                "role": "TIMING",
+                "roles": [
+                  "TIMING",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Annual Yin repeats the natal Yin, clashes with natal Shen, harms the luck-pillar Si, and reinforces the Yin–Si–Shen network.",
+                "start": 2180,
+                "end": 2304,
+                "role": "TIMING",
+                "roles": [
+                  "TIMING",
+                  "MECHANISM",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Fire may warm and activate, but it cannot replace Earth-and-Metal support.",
+                "start": 4487,
+                "end": 4561,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY",
+                  "MECHANISM",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              }
+            ],
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "It cannot be assigned to a definite life stage or used to assert a concrete event.",
+                "start": 243,
+                "end": 325,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "None of these should be translated directly into an inevitable conflict, loss, or relationship event.",
+                "start": 1839,
+                "end": 1940,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "This repeated and overlapping activation makes adjustment within adjustment a defining feature of the period.",
+                "start": 2305,
+                "end": 2414,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "As one arrangement moves forward, it may be pulled simultaneously by the natal structure, the long-term cycle, and the annual demand.",
+                "start": 2415,
+                "end": 2548,
+                "role": "TIMING",
+                "roles": [
+                  "TIMING"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "This indicates concentrated structural pressure, not a prediction of relocation, interpersonal rupture, illness, or any other event.",
+                "start": 2549,
+                "end": 2681,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The strengthened Yin–Shen clash does not cancel the natal combination, and that combination does not erase the clash; both mechanisms remain operative.",
+                "start": 2682,
+                "end": 2833,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "This can give the chart’s active output-and-realization pathway a clearer rhythm.",
+                "start": 2979,
+                "end": 3060,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "For that to occur, however, Earth’s carrying function must reach the level of actual execution, and the boundaries and continuity associated with Metal must not be depleted.",
+                "start": 3061,
+                "end": 3234,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "Where rules are clear, responsibilities remain limited, and review mechanisms are real, the multiple activations can manifest as intensive but effective adjustment: older arrangements are updated and new requirements are incorporated into a manageable order.",
+                "start": 3235,
+                "end": 3493,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "If shared support exists only verbally, hidden overload may still concentrate in one place.",
+                "start": 4144,
+                "end": 4235,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "If collaboration genuinely shares maintenance and review, the period’s intensity is more likely to become sustainable output.",
+                "start": 4236,
+                "end": 4361,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "The governing theme of this timing is therefore the construction of carrying capacity amid acceleration and reorganization.",
+                "start": 4363,
+                "end": 4486,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S10",
+                "locale": "en",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              }
+            ]
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [
+            {
+              "text": "No Gregorian year, age, start date, or end date has been provided, so this combination can only be examined as a structural interaction with the natal chart.",
+              "start": 85,
+              "end": 242,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "Both activity and the need for coordination are consequently heightened.",
+              "start": 488,
+              "end": 560,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "The central feature is not the arrival of one isolated influence, but the simultaneous activation of support, seasonal warming, and several branch relationships.",
+              "start": 326,
+              "end": 487,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "en",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PASS",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "TIMING",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+          ]
+        }
+      }
+    ],
+    "closingSummary": {
+      "zh-Hans": [
+        null,
+        null,
+        null
+      ],
+      "en": [
+        {
+          "text": "The principal vulnerability in this chart is not simply the volume of external demands.",
+          "start": 0,
+          "end": 87,
+          "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+          "roles": [
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+          ],
+          "sectionId": "S08",
+          "locale": "en",
+          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+          "paragraphIndex": 0
+        },
+        {
+          "text": "Long-term cycles do not replace the natal structure with a new destiny.",
+          "start": 0,
+          "end": 71,
+          "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+          "roles": [
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+          ],
+          "sectionId": "S09",
+          "locale": "en",
+          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+          "paragraphIndex": 0
