+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "现实中，这类能力常表现为快速抓住问题关键，把复杂材料重新组织成清晰方案，或把抽象知识转译成别人能够采用的产品、方法、说明与判断依据。",
+                "start": 532,
+                "end": 598,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "这里所说的是结构倾向，并不等于必然具有某一种职业、学历或既定成就。",
+                "start": 598,
+                "end": 631,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "面对含混、低效或逻辑不一致的情况，往往较难仅以表面和谐掩盖问题，而更愿意直接辨别、修正和推进。",
+                "start": 662,
+                "end": 709,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "若合作关系具有清楚分工和相互尊重，个人判断与群体资源能够彼此增强。",
+                "start": 778,
+                "end": 811,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "寅申冲与三合水局同时存在，为能力表现加入了一层重要的动态性。",
+                "start": 874,
+                "end": 904,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "一方面，思路能够围绕问题迅速汇集，形成连续的分析与输出；另一方面，内部并不会完全停留在单一轨道上，而是容易出现重新校正、转换角度或推翻原方案的力量。",
+                "start": 904,
+                "end": 978,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "运作顺畅时，这使人兼具集中与修正能力，既能形成方案，也能察觉方案的盲点。",
+                "start": 978,
+                "end": 1014,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "土的作用在于让信息能够被吸收、归档并转化为可重复使用的经验，金的作用则在于维持判断尺度、工具能力与同类协作。",
+                "start": 1217,
+                "end": 1271,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "因此，这一结构最成熟的状态，不是无限提高反应速度，而是在清晰判断、充分承载与现实转化之间建立节奏。",
+                "start": 1512,
+                "end": 1561,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              }
+            ],
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "此命以庚金为日主，生于子月，月令伤官当令，申子辰三合水局成立，使水所代表的表达、输出、流通与成果转化成为结构中的显著动力。",
+                "start": 0,
+                "end": 61,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "因此，命局不能只按一片水势理解，而应看作输出力量集中、内在支撑仍在、局部又持续受到牵动的复合结构。",
+                "start": 115,
+                "end": 164,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "伤官格沿着伤官生财的路径成立，意味着能力的核心不只在于知道多少，更在于能否把理解转成可使用、可交换、可衡量的价值。",
+                "start": 385,
+                "end": 442,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "伤官使人倾向于辨认差异、发现不合理之处，并寻找更有效率的表达或做法；财星承接这种输出，使思考不容易停留在纯粹评论，而会自然追问结果是否落地、资源是否得到运用、投入是否产生实际回报。",
+                "start": 442,
+                "end": 532,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "庚金与比肩的显著性，使这种表达通常带有明确边界和标准意识。",
+                "start": 633,
+                "end": 662,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "若责任边界不明，伤官的纠错倾向与比肩的自主性则可能使沟通变得过于锋利，或出现每个人都在表达、却没有足够结构完成收束的情况。",
+                "start": 811,
+                "end": 872,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "这一命局真正需要保护的，不是表达能力本身，而是表达背后的承载能力。",
+                "start": 1126,
+                "end": 1159,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "其核心能力由此呈现为：看得出差异，讲得清逻辑，做得出成果，同时也需要有足够稳定的基础，让这些能力可以持续而不被自身的高输出透支。",
+                "start": 1561,
+                "end": 1625,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S02",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              }
+            ]
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [
+            {
+              "text": "不过，这一三合并未达到五行完全转化，申、辰原有的藏干与结构作用仍然保留；同时寅申冲并存，对水局成员形成修正。",
+              "start": 61,
+              "end": 115,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "由此形成的性格并非单纯强硬，也不是被动柔弱，而是外在判断清楚、反应迅速，内里却需要稳定基础才能长期维持高质量输出。",
+              "start": 326,
+              "end": 383,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "庚金虽有申中同根，天干又见多个庚金比肩，显示自我标准、独立判断与同类支持并不缺席，但子月本属泄气环境，伤官及水局提高了输出强度，日主需要不断把自身力量转化为观察、判断、表达和实际成果。",
+              "start": 177,
+              "end": 269,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            }
+          ],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PASS",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "MECHANISM",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+          ]
+        },
+        "en": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [],
+            []
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PUBLICATION_REPAIR",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "MECHANISM",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+            "BOUNDARY"
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "sectionId": "S03",
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "人生结构与运行方式",
+          "en": "Life Structure and Operating Patterns"
+        },
+        "titleTrace": {
+          "owner": "BAZI_SECTION_PURPOSE",
+          "sectionId": "S03",
+          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3"
+        },
+        "zh-Hans": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "这个链条能够快速启动，因此面对新问题时，往往不是等待条件完全成熟后才行动，而是在理解过程中便开始组织答案。",
+                "start": 49,
+                "end": 102,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "这一结构天然重视有效性。",
+                "start": 219,
+                "end": 231,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "责任承担也遵循同样的逻辑。",
+                "start": 459,
+                "end": 472,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "清楚、有边界并且可以完成闭环的责任，能够调动判断力与执行力；含混、不断扩张又缺乏资源对应的责任，则会使结构中的泄耗被持续放大。",
+                "start": 472,
+                "end": 535,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "由于比肩支持明显，承担并不必然要以单独完成为前提。",
+                "start": 535,
+                "end": 560,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "现实中更有效的方式，往往是由各自具备能力的人共同负责，并明确谁作判断、谁提供资源、谁完成交付。",
+                "start": 560,
+                "end": 607,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "申子辰的汇聚与寅申冲的修正同时存在，使人生运行带有“成形—校正—再成形”的特点。",
+                "start": 682,
+                "end": 722,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "计划能够围绕目标聚拢，但很少因为初步成形便完全停止变化。",
+                "start": 722,
+                "end": 750,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "顺畅时，这是一种适应复杂环境的能力：既能保持主线，又允许证据改变做法。",
+                "start": 750,
+                "end": 785,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "失衡时，则可能在方案尚未得到充分执行前便持续优化，或者因同时看见多个可行方向而分散投入。",
+                "start": 785,
+                "end": 829,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "财星也使现实安排和承诺具有重要分量。",
+                "start": 1181,
+                "end": 1199,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "相反，若安排只停留在口头期待，或条件持续变化而没有重新确认边界，输出会被反复调用，最终形成隐性负担。",
+                "start": 1245,
+                "end": 1295,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "火的出现需分层理解：它在调候上可能带来温暖和启动，在现实运作中也可能表现为规则、时限、压力或推动力，其效果取决于土金基础是否足以承接。",
+                "start": 1565,
+                "end": 1632,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              }
+            ],
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "因此，学习通常在能够解释现实问题、建立方法或提高判断质量时最有力量。",
+                "start": 284,
+                "end": 318,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "当外界只看见快速成果时，隐藏的准备工作容易被低估；当本人也忽略这一层，便可能误以为继续增加任务量就是提高能力，实际上却削弱了下一阶段的稳定性。",
+                "start": 386,
+                "end": 457,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "表面上事情已经安排妥当，实际上承载压力仍未真正分散。",
+                "start": 654,
+                "end": 680,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "问题不一定是缺少决定，而可能是每一个决定都迅速引出下一层需要处理的细节。",
+                "start": 829,
+                "end": 865,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "在资源与金钱层面，伤官生财更强调“创造与转化”，却不自动等同于“保存与积累”。",
+                "start": 900,
+                "end": 939,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "收入、项目、客户需求或可交换价值，可能来自知识、表达、分析、技术和解决问题的能力，但取得成果与保留成果属于不同环节。",
+                "start": 939,
+                "end": 997,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "答应的事项若能被清楚定义、按条件兑现，伤官的输出便有明确去向，个人能力也更容易获得现实反馈。",
+                "start": 1199,
+                "end": 1245,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "这样既能保留伤官生财的效率，也能避免成果建立在不可持续的额外消耗上。",
+                "start": 1331,
+                "end": 1365,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "水木主题增强时，表达、项目流量、成果要求及资源转化可能更受强调；这可以扩大可见产出，也可能加重日主偏弱一侧的耗泄。",
+                "start": 1508,
+                "end": 1565,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "做到这些时，表达、现实转化与持续成长会形成正向循环；若只看见外在成果而忽略隐藏负荷，运行方式便容易从高效率逐渐滑向高消耗。",
+                "start": 1763,
+                "end": 1824,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S03",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 7
+              }
+            ]
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [
+            {
+              "text": "人生结构的主要运行方式，是先接收与分辨信息，再形成表达和方案，继而把输出导向资源、成果或现实安排。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 49,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "其长处是学习与应用之间距离较短，能够一边处理材料，一边辨认其中可被改善、交换或落实的部分；但整个人生节奏也容易被“持续产生结果”的要求牵引。",
+              "start": 102,
+              "end": 172,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "真正决定运行质量的，不只是机会多少，而是每一轮输出之后是否有足够空间完成吸收、整理和恢复。",
+              "start": 172,
+              "end": 217,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PASS",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "MECHANISM"
+          ]
+        },
+        "en": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [],
+            []
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PUBLICATION_REPAIR",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+            "MECHANISM",
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "TIMING"
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "sectionId": "S04",
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "事业发展与职业方向",
+          "en": "Career Development and Direction"
+        },
+        "titleTrace": {
+          "owner": "BAZI_SECTION_PURPOSE",
+          "sectionId": "S04",
+          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3"
+        },
+        "zh-Hans": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "因此，职业能力较容易集中在分析、策划、研究、产品、技术转译、咨询、流程改进、商业判断、内容与知识应用等功能上。",
+                "start": 194,
+                "end": 249,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "这里列举的是工作功能而不是命定职业。",
+                "start": 249,
+                "end": 267,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "庚金的标准意识与比肩结构，使职业上较重视专业判断、工作边界和成果质量。",
+                "start": 421,
+                "end": 456,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "完全依赖模糊权威、却不允许提出依据和改进意见的环境，可能较难长期发挥；相较之下，目标清楚、责任可讨论、专业意见能够进入决策的组织，更能容纳这一结构。",
+                "start": 456,
+                "end": 530,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "自主性并不等于必须独立创业。",
+                "start": 530,
+                "end": 544,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "它也可以表现为在组织内拥有清楚的专业领域，能够对方法和质量负责，并与能力相当的同事协作。",
+                "start": 544,
+                "end": 588,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "丙火七杀藏于寅支，并非透干的主导力量；事业中它提示正式责任、标准、期限与交付后果，而伤官生财强调输出如何变成可用价值。",
+                "start": 664,
+                "end": 723,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "它不只适合“说”，也适合通过分析、设计、技术、系统或方法让事情变得更有效。",
+                "start": 831,
+                "end": 868,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "真正成熟的职业竞争力，往往不是一次性的聪明反应，而是把成功经验整理成可复制的流程，使个人判断逐步变为稳定能力。",
+                "start": 868,
+                "end": 923,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "若长期只追逐即时交付，职业表现可能仍然活跃，但能力更新会逐渐落后于任务增长。",
+                "start": 977,
+                "end": 1015,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "短期看，这能维持成果；长期看，却会把专业能力消耗在重复补位上。",
+                "start": 1149,
+                "end": 1180,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "水木主题增强时，市场接触、表达、项目与收益机会可能更活跃，同时也更考验容量和资源保留。",
+                "start": 1767,
+                "end": 1810,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 9
+              }
+            ],
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "这些方向能否成为实际事业，仍取决于教育、经验、机会与所处环境，命局本身不保证职位、收入或成就。",
+                "start": 372,
+                "end": 419,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "伤官的纠错判断与七杀的责任压力需要分开看：提出改进不等于已有执行权限；偏印的训练、流程与比肩的可靠协作，才是承接标准和期限的支持条件。",
+                "start": 725,
+                "end": 792,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "事业压力较大时，结构最容易出现的失真，是前端输出持续增加，后端承载却没有同步扩充。",
+                "start": 1017,
+                "end": 1058,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "比肩的自主性也可能使人倾向于亲自把关，当协作质量不足时，更容易把他人的未完成部分重新纳入自己的责任。",
+                "start": 1099,
+                "end": 1149,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "事业上的关键制衡并不是降低标准，而是让标准进入流程、工具和分工，使质量不必完全依赖个人持续加压。",
+                "start": 1180,
+                "end": 1228,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "有效的职业安排会把价值说清楚，也把不包含的部分说清楚；会确认何时算完成，以及新增要求如何重新配置资源。",
+                "start": 1303,
+                "end": 1354,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 7
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "在组织角色上，这一结构既可以成为专业贡献者，也可能承担项目整合、方案判断或连接专业与商业的职责。",
+                "start": 1426,
+                "end": 1474,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 8
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "若角色要求长期吸收模糊责任，却没有相应权限和资源，则容易形成表面职位上升、实际负荷失衡的情况。",
+                "start": 1538,
+                "end": 1585,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 8
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "火在调候上具有温暖候选意义，在职业现实中则可能对应更强的规范、曝光、竞争、时限或责任推动；若基础充足，它可以促成行动与成形，若基础不足，则可能先体现为压力。",
+                "start": 1810,
+                "end": 1888,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 9
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "任何一种五行出现，都不能脱离全局而直接等同于升迁、财富或某项确定事件。",
+                "start": 1888,
+                "end": 1923,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 9
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "事业发展的理想方向，是让敏锐判断不只解决眼前问题，而逐步形成可积累的专业系统。",
+                "start": 1925,
+                "end": 1964,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S04",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 10
+              }
+            ]
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [
+            {
+              "text": "适合发挥的职业环境通常需要一定复杂度：材料并非完全标准化，问题需要判断，成果又必须能够被他人使用或转化为实际决定。",
+              "start": 58,
+              "end": 115,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "事业发展的核心，不在于选择一个固定行业名称，而在于工作是否允许“辨认问题—形成表达—创造现实价值”这一链条完整运作。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 58,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "若从事经营、自由职业或管理工作，则需要特别注意：能够提出方向和取得项目，并不等于后续承载会自动形成，后台流程、资源配置和交付能力必须与前端机会同步。",
+              "start": 588,
+              "end": 662,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            }
+          ],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PASS",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "MECHANISM"
+          ]
+        },
+        "en": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [],
+            []
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PUBLICATION_REPAIR",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "MECHANISM",
+            "TIMING"
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "sectionId": "S05",
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "资源与财富",
+          "en": "Resources and Wealth"
+        },
+        "titleTrace": {
+          "owner": "BAZI_SECTION_PURPOSE",
+          "sectionId": "S05",
+          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3"
+        },
+        "zh-Hans": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "月干偏财明透，地支又见正财与偏财暗藏，说明财富议题既有公开可见、需要主动把握的一面，也有嵌在长期安排、细节义务与持续经营之中的一面。",
+                "start": 108,
+                "end": 174,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "这一区分尤其重要：收入形成与财富保留并不是同一件事。",
+                "start": 225,
+                "end": 251,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "伤官生财擅长把想法、能力与市场需求连接起来，但日主处于偏弱一侧时，输出越旺，随之而来的交付、管理、沟通和后续责任也越多。",
+                "start": 251,
+                "end": 311,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "比肩多见，使资源运作带有明显的自主性与同层协作色彩。",
+                "start": 445,
+                "end": 471,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "它可以表现为依靠自身判断推进，也可以表现为与伙伴、同业或团队共同调动资源。",
+                "start": 471,
+                "end": 508,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "土印是这一财富结构中更关键的承载条件。",
+                "start": 675,
+                "end": 694,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "土为首要用神、金为辅助，所强调的正是先稳住主体与执行基础，再让输出和财星继续流通。",
+                "start": 874,
+                "end": 915,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "较顺畅的状态则是将价值主张、价格条件、交付范围与后续责任放在同一套安排中，使所得与所担相称，让完成一项安排本身成为财富保留的一部分。",
+                "start": 1102,
+                "end": 1168,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "火若在具体时序中出现，仍须观察它是否有助于整体运行，而非仅凭季节便作吉凶判断。",
+                "start": 1235,
+                "end": 1274,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "同样，水木增强的阶段可能提高表达、交易与资源流动的显著度，同时也会增加交付压力；土金较能发挥作用的阶段，则较有利于整理结构、补充能力与巩固留存。",
+                "start": 1274,
+                "end": 1346,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "能够成立的结论，是不同阶段会改变财富链条中“创造机会”与“承接成果”的相对重点，而最终质量仍取决于二者是否同步。",
+                "start": 1413,
+                "end": 1469,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              }
+            ],
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "这里能够确认的是变现通道具有结构基础，却不能据此推定财富规模，更不能把机会出现等同于成果已经留存。",
+                "start": 174,
+                "end": 223,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "若只追求更多项目、更快周转或更广覆盖，表面上的业务增长可能领先于实际承载能力。",
+                "start": 311,
+                "end": 350,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "现实中，这常体现为能够发现机会、提出方案并推动成交，却需要额外处理时间成本、质量控制、履约边界和持续维护。",
+                "start": 350,
+                "end": 403,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "其有利之处在于遇到任务时并非全无支点，能够通过分工、复核和共同执行扩大承载；其压力面则是资源也可能在多人、多项目或多重优先事项之间被分流。",
+                "start": 508,
+                "end": 577,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "比肩并不自动代表竞争或破财，但当权限、成本、收益与责任没有清楚界定时，原本用于支持的协作关系就可能增加协调损耗。",
+                "start": 577,
+                "end": 633,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "反之，规则透明、职责可核验时，共享资源反而能保护伤官生财不因个人负荷过重而失真。",
+                "start": 633,
+                "end": 673,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "若忽略这些不易被看见的成本，便容易把全部注意力放在前端机会，直到履约压力积累后才发现后台不足。",
+                "start": 827,
+                "end": 874,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "于是忙碌可能增加，实际完成度却未同步提升；收入可能形成，留存却被追加投入、协作成本或未结责任消耗。",
+                "start": 967,
+                "end": 1016,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "这些都不是必然事件，而是结构在负荷超过承载时的常见方向。",
+                "start": 1074,
+                "end": 1102,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S05",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              }
+            ]
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [
+            {
+              "text": "结构真正要求的不是压低输出，而是让每一次输出都由足够的流程、储备和执行能力接住。",
+              "start": 403,
+              "end": 443,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "水的结构显著度使知识、技术、判断、表达与解决问题的能力容易向外流动，再由木财承接为项目、交易、客户需求、可交付成果或具体责任。",
+              "start": 45,
+              "end": 108,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "资源与财富的重点，不在于把财星简单理解为钱财多寡，而在于既有的伤官生财路径能否被稳定承载。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 45,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PASS",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+            "MECHANISM",
+            "BOUNDARY",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+          ]
+        },
+        "en": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [],
+            []
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PUBLICATION_REPAIR",
+          "sourceRoles": [
+            "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+            "MECHANISM",
+            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+            "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+            "TIMING"
+          ]
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "sectionId": "S06",
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "关系与亲密模式",
+          "en": "Relationships and Intimacy"
+        },
+        "titleTrace": {
+          "owner": "BAZI_SECTION_PURPOSE",
+          "sectionId": "S06",
+          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3"
+        },
+        "zh-Hans": {
+          "excerpts": [
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "关系是否顺畅，往往不只取决于心意是否存在，还取决于说出的内容能否转化为双方都能承受的安排。",
+                "start": 179,
+                "end": 224,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "二者结合时，较自然的关系方式是保留各自判断，同时通过坦白沟通建立合作。",
+                "start": 270,
+                "end": 305,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "顺畅表达可以是直接说明需要、讨论现实限制、共同改进生活安排；它并不要求任何一方放弃独立性。",
+                "start": 305,
+                "end": 350,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "反过来，如果表达只剩评判、解释或效率要求，关系便可能听见结论，却感受不到承接过程。",
+                "start": 393,
+                "end": 434,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "申子辰三合水局与寅申冲同时存在，为关系结构增添了一个重要层次：一方面有把经验、信息与共同目标组织起来的能力，另一方面，系统内部仍保留修正、拉动与不同节奏。",
+                "start": 436,
+                "end": 513,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "此时，隐藏负荷未必立即显现，可能先表现为持续协调、反复说明或试图独自把事情处理妥当。",
+                "start": 726,
+                "end": 768,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "比肩较多也使平等成为重要议题。",
+                "start": 871,
+                "end": 886,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "平等运作良好时，双方各自有判断，又愿意共享信息、分担任务并接受复核；运作失衡时，则可能出现每个人都坚持自己的处理方式，或者表面共同承担，实际责任却无人完整承接。",
+                "start": 886,
+                "end": 966,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "财星所代表的现实安排，需要从“愿意做什么”进一步落到“由谁完成、何时完成、完成到什么程度”。",
+                "start": 966,
+                "end": 1012,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "这种明确并非削弱亲密，反而能让承诺具有可依赖性。",
+                "start": 1012,
+                "end": 1036,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "对于这一结构而言，可靠的关系不只是情绪浓度高，而是表达、资源与履约能够彼此对应。",
+                "start": 1036,
+                "end": 1076,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 4
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "土印与金比劫构成较重要的制衡。",
+                "start": 1078,
+                "end": 1093,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM",
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "具体时序会改变关系中哪一层更突出。",
+                "start": 1242,
+                "end": 1259,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              }
+            ],
+            [
+              {
+                "text": "关系与亲密模式中，财星不能被机械地等同于某一位配偶，也不能由其位置直接推断婚姻事实。",
+                "start": 0,
+                "end": 42,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY",
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "既有的伤官生财路径，使关系不只停留在感受或理念层面，而倾向于通过解决问题、落实安排、投入时间与资源来确认价值。",
+                "start": 75,
+                "end": 130,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 0
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "伤官带来较强的辨识、表达与修正功能，比肩则强调自主、平等和不愿完全依附于单一权威的倾向。",
+                "start": 226,
+                "end": 270,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "若彼此能够把不同意见当作信息，伤官的敏锐可帮助发现问题，比肩的平等感也能维持相互尊重。",
+                "start": 350,
+                "end": 393,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 1
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "冲并没有取消三合，三合也没有消除冲，因此不能把这种并存简单翻译为必然争执、分离或迁移。",
+                "start": 513,
+                "end": 556,
+                "role": "BOUNDARY",
+                "roles": [
+                  "BOUNDARY",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "放在亲密互动中，它更适合被理解为连续性与调整需求同时存在。",
+                "start": 556,
+                "end": 585,
+                "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 2
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "伤官生财容易以行动、方案和实际承担表达重视，但当外部需求增加时，提供帮助与承担责任可能快于自身恢复。",
+                "start": 676,
+                "end": 726,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "若双方只看见结果，没有看见支持结果所需的时间与资源，原本出于负责的投入便可能转为疲惫。",
+                "start": 768,
+                "end": 811,
+                "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "roles": [
+                  "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 3
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "印使关系中的表达不只追求即时反应，还能经过理解、沉淀与复盘；金则帮助主体保持清楚的立场和可执行边界。",
+                "start": 1093,
+                "end": 1143,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "两者足够时，伤官的锋利可以转化为诚实而有建设性的沟通，财星的投入也较不容易变成无止境的责任扩张。",
+                "start": 1143,
+                "end": 1191,
+                "role": "MECHANISM",
+                "roles": [
+                  "MECHANISM"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 5
+              },
+              {
+                "text": "若火在适当条件下参与，它可能改善整体运行的温度与流通，但仍须结合全局判断。",
+                "start": 1333,
+                "end": 1370,
+                "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "roles": [
+                  "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+                ],
+                "sectionId": "S06",
+                "locale": "zh-Hans",
+                "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+                "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+                "paragraphIndex": 6
+              }
+            ]
+          ],
+          "insightCards": [
+            {
+              "text": "这里更可靠的阅读，是观察一个人如何把表达、选择与现实责任连接起来。",
+              "start": 42,
+              "end": 75,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "偏财明透而正财暗藏，意味着互动既可能需要灵活回应当下情境，也需要照顾长期承诺、细节秩序与可持续性。",
+              "start": 130,
+              "end": 179,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "日主的承载条件使亲密关系中的“付出”需要特别注意边界。",
+              "start": 649,
+              "end": 676,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            }
+          ],
+          "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
+          "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2",
+          "selectionStatus": "PASS",
