+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_A",
+        "sectionId": "S02",
+        "excerptIndex": 0,
+        "pageNumber": 13,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "核心性格与能力",
+          "en": "Core Character and Capability"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "日主旺衰定为中和偏弱。",
+              "start": 166,
+              "end": 177,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "现实中，这类能力常表现为快速抓住问题关键，把复杂材料重新组织成清晰方案，或把抽象知识转译成别人能够采用的产品、方法、说明与判断依据。",
+              "start": 532,
+              "end": 598,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这里所说的是结构倾向，并不等于必然具有某一种职业、学历或既定成就。",
+              "start": 598,
+              "end": 631,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "面对含混、低效或逻辑不一致的情况，往往较难仅以表面和谐掩盖问题，而更愿意直接辨别、修正和推进。",
+              "start": 662,
+              "end": 709,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "若合作关系具有清楚分工和相互尊重，个人判断与群体资源能够彼此增强。",
+              "start": 778,
+              "end": 811,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "寅申冲与三合水局同时存在，为能力表现加入了一层重要的动态性。",
+              "start": 874,
+              "end": 904,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "一方面，思路能够围绕问题迅速汇集，形成连续的分析与输出；另一方面，内部并不会完全停留在单一轨道上，而是容易出现重新校正、转换角度或推翻原方案的力量。",
+              "start": 904,
+              "end": 978,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "运作顺畅时，这使人兼具集中与修正能力，既能形成方案，也能察觉方案的盲点。",
+              "start": 978,
+              "end": 1014,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "土的作用在于让信息能够被吸收、归档并转化为可重复使用的经验，金的作用则在于维持判断尺度、工具能力与同类协作。",
+              "start": 1217,
+              "end": 1271,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "因此，这一结构最成熟的状态，不是无限提高反应速度，而是在清晰判断、充分承载与现实转化之间建立节奏。",
+              "start": 1512,
+              "end": 1561,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_B",
+        "sectionId": "S02",
+        "excerptIndex": 1,
+        "pageNumber": 14,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "核心性格与能力",
+          "en": "Core Character and Capability"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "此命以庚金为日主，生于子月，月令伤官当令，申子辰三合水局成立，使水所代表的表达、输出、流通与成果转化成为结构中的显著动力。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 61,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "因此，命局不能只按一片水势理解，而应看作输出力量集中、内在支撑仍在、局部又持续受到牵动的复合结构。",
+              "start": 115,
+              "end": 164,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "伤官格沿着伤官生财的路径成立，意味着能力的核心不只在于知道多少，更在于能否把理解转成可使用、可交换、可衡量的价值。",
+              "start": 385,
+              "end": 442,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "伤官使人倾向于辨认差异、发现不合理之处，并寻找更有效率的表达或做法；财星承接这种输出，使思考不容易停留在纯粹评论，而会自然追问结果是否落地、资源是否得到运用、投入是否产生实际回报。",
+              "start": 442,
+              "end": 532,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "庚金与比肩的显著性，使这种表达通常带有明确边界和标准意识。",
+              "start": 633,
+              "end": 662,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "若责任边界不明，伤官的纠错倾向与比肩的自主性则可能使沟通变得过于锋利，或出现每个人都在表达、却没有足够结构完成收束的情况。",
+              "start": 811,
+              "end": 872,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这一命局真正需要保护的，不是表达能力本身，而是表达背后的承载能力。",
+              "start": 1126,
+              "end": 1159,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "其核心能力由此呈现为：看得出差异，讲得清逻辑，做得出成果，同时也需要有足够稳定的基础，让这些能力可以持续而不被自身的高输出透支。",
+              "start": 1561,
+              "end": 1625,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S02",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_OPENER",
+        "sectionId": "S03",
+        "pageNumber": 15,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "人生结构与运行方式",
+          "en": "Life Structure and Operating Patterns"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-03-LIFE-STRUCTURE.webp",
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "人生结构的主要运行方式，是先接收与分辨信息，再形成表达和方案，继而把输出导向资源、成果或现实安排。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 49,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "其长处是学习与应用之间距离较短，能够一边处理材料，一边辨认其中可被改善、交换或落实的部分；但整个人生节奏也容易被“持续产生结果”的要求牵引。",
+              "start": 102,
+              "end": 172,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "真正决定运行质量的，不只是机会多少，而是每一轮输出之后是否有足够空间完成吸收、整理和恢复。",
+              "start": 172,
+              "end": 217,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_DIAGRAM",
+        "sectionId": "S03",
+        "diagramId": "D07",
+        "pageNumber": 16,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "人生结构与运行方式",
+          "en": "Life Structure and Operating Patterns"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_A",
+        "sectionId": "S03",
+        "excerptIndex": 0,
+        "pageNumber": 17,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "人生结构与运行方式",
+          "en": "Life Structure and Operating Patterns"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "这个链条能够快速启动，因此面对新问题时，往往不是等待条件完全成熟后才行动，而是在理解过程中便开始组织答案。",
+              "start": 49,
+              "end": 102,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这一结构天然重视有效性。",
+              "start": 219,
+              "end": 231,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "责任承担也遵循同样的逻辑。",
+              "start": 459,
+              "end": 472,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "清楚、有边界并且可以完成闭环的责任，能够调动判断力与执行力；含混、不断扩张又缺乏资源对应的责任，则会使结构中的泄耗被持续放大。",
+              "start": 472,
+              "end": 535,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "由于比肩支持明显，承担并不必然要以单独完成为前提。",
+              "start": 535,
+              "end": 560,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "现实中更有效的方式，往往是由各自具备能力的人共同负责，并明确谁作判断、谁提供资源、谁完成交付。",
+              "start": 560,
+              "end": 607,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "申子辰的汇聚与寅申冲的修正同时存在，使人生运行带有“成形—校正—再成形”的特点。",
+              "start": 682,
+              "end": 722,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "计划能够围绕目标聚拢，但很少因为初步成形便完全停止变化。",
+              "start": 722,
+              "end": 750,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "顺畅时，这是一种适应复杂环境的能力：既能保持主线，又允许证据改变做法。",
+              "start": 750,
+              "end": 785,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "失衡时，则可能在方案尚未得到充分执行前便持续优化，或者因同时看见多个可行方向而分散投入。",
+              "start": 785,
+              "end": 829,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "财星也使现实安排和承诺具有重要分量。",
+              "start": 1181,
+              "end": 1199,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "相反，若安排只停留在口头期待，或条件持续变化而没有重新确认边界，输出会被反复调用，最终形成隐性负担。",
+              "start": 1245,
+              "end": 1295,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "火的出现需分层理解：它在调候上可能带来温暖和启动，在现实运作中也可能表现为规则、时限、压力或推动力，其效果取决于土金基础是否足以承接。",
+              "start": 1565,
+              "end": 1632,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_B",
+        "sectionId": "S03",
+        "excerptIndex": 1,
+        "pageNumber": 18,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "人生结构与运行方式",
+          "en": "Life Structure and Operating Patterns"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "因此，学习通常在能够解释现实问题、建立方法或提高判断质量时最有力量。",
+              "start": 284,
+              "end": 318,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "当外界只看见快速成果时，隐藏的准备工作容易被低估；当本人也忽略这一层，便可能误以为继续增加任务量就是提高能力，实际上却削弱了下一阶段的稳定性。",
+              "start": 386,
+              "end": 457,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "表面上事情已经安排妥当，实际上承载压力仍未真正分散。",
+              "start": 654,
+              "end": 680,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "问题不一定是缺少决定，而可能是每一个决定都迅速引出下一层需要处理的细节。",
+              "start": 829,
+              "end": 865,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "在资源与金钱层面，伤官生财更强调“创造与转化”，却不自动等同于“保存与积累”。",
+              "start": 900,
+              "end": 939,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "收入、项目、客户需求或可交换价值，可能来自知识、表达、分析、技术和解决问题的能力，但取得成果与保留成果属于不同环节。",
+              "start": 939,
+              "end": 997,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "答应的事项若能被清楚定义、按条件兑现，伤官的输出便有明确去向，个人能力也更容易获得现实反馈。",
+              "start": 1199,
+              "end": 1245,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这样既能保留伤官生财的效率，也能避免成果建立在不可持续的额外消耗上。",
+              "start": 1331,
+              "end": 1365,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "水木主题增强时，表达、项目流量、成果要求及资源转化可能更受强调；这可以扩大可见产出，也可能加重日主偏弱一侧的耗泄。",
+              "start": 1508,
+              "end": 1565,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "做到这些时，表达、现实转化与持续成长会形成正向循环；若只看见外在成果而忽略隐藏负荷，运行方式便容易从高效率逐渐滑向高消耗。",
+              "start": 1763,
+              "end": 1824,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S03",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 7
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_OPENER",
+        "sectionId": "S04",
+        "pageNumber": 19,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "事业发展与职业方向",
+          "en": "Career Development and Direction"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-04-CAREER.webp",
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "适合发挥的职业环境通常需要一定复杂度：材料并非完全标准化，问题需要判断，成果又必须能够被他人使用或转化为实际决定。",
+              "start": 58,
+              "end": 115,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "事业发展的核心，不在于选择一个固定行业名称，而在于工作是否允许“辨认问题—形成表达—创造现实价值”这一链条完整运作。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 58,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "若从事经营、自由职业或管理工作，则需要特别注意：能够提出方向和取得项目，并不等于后续承载会自动形成，后台流程、资源配置和交付能力必须与前端机会同步。",
+              "start": 588,
+              "end": 662,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_DIAGRAM",
+        "sectionId": "S04",
+        "diagramId": "D08",
+        "pageNumber": 20,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "事业发展与职业方向",
+          "en": "Career Development and Direction"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_A",
+        "sectionId": "S04",
+        "excerptIndex": 0,
+        "pageNumber": 21,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "事业发展与职业方向",
+          "en": "Career Development and Direction"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "因此，职业能力较容易集中在分析、策划、研究、产品、技术转译、咨询、流程改进、商业判断、内容与知识应用等功能上。",
+              "start": 194,
+              "end": 249,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这里列举的是工作功能而不是命定职业。",
+              "start": 249,
+              "end": 267,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "庚金的标准意识与比肩结构，使职业上较重视专业判断、工作边界和成果质量。",
+              "start": 421,
+              "end": 456,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "完全依赖模糊权威、却不允许提出依据和改进意见的环境，可能较难长期发挥；相较之下，目标清楚、责任可讨论、专业意见能够进入决策的组织，更能容纳这一结构。",
+              "start": 456,
+              "end": 530,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "自主性并不等于必须独立创业。",
+              "start": 530,
+              "end": 544,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "它也可以表现为在组织内拥有清楚的专业领域，能够对方法和质量负责，并与能力相当的同事协作。",
+              "start": 544,
+              "end": 588,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "丙火七杀藏于寅支，并非透干的主导力量；事业中它提示正式责任、标准、期限与交付后果，而伤官生财强调输出如何变成可用价值。",
+              "start": 664,
+              "end": 723,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "它不只适合“说”，也适合通过分析、设计、技术、系统或方法让事情变得更有效。",
+              "start": 831,
+              "end": 868,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "真正成熟的职业竞争力，往往不是一次性的聪明反应，而是把成功经验整理成可复制的流程，使个人判断逐步变为稳定能力。",
+              "start": 868,
+              "end": 923,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "若长期只追逐即时交付，职业表现可能仍然活跃，但能力更新会逐渐落后于任务增长。",
+              "start": 977,
+              "end": 1015,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "短期看，这能维持成果；长期看，却会把专业能力消耗在重复补位上。",
+              "start": 1149,
+              "end": 1180,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "水木主题增强时，市场接触、表达、项目与收益机会可能更活跃，同时也更考验容量和资源保留。",
+              "start": 1767,
+              "end": 1810,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 9
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_B",
+        "sectionId": "S04",
+        "excerptIndex": 1,
+        "pageNumber": 22,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "事业发展与职业方向",
+          "en": "Career Development and Direction"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "这些方向能否成为实际事业，仍取决于教育、经验、机会与所处环境，命局本身不保证职位、收入或成就。",
+              "start": 372,
+              "end": 419,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "伤官的纠错判断与七杀的责任压力需要分开看：提出改进不等于已有执行权限；偏印的训练、流程与比肩的可靠协作，才是承接标准和期限的支持条件。",
+              "start": 725,
+              "end": 792,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "事业压力较大时，结构最容易出现的失真，是前端输出持续增加，后端承载却没有同步扩充。",
+              "start": 1017,
+              "end": 1058,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "比肩的自主性也可能使人倾向于亲自把关，当协作质量不足时，更容易把他人的未完成部分重新纳入自己的责任。",
+              "start": 1099,
+              "end": 1149,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "事业上的关键制衡并不是降低标准，而是让标准进入流程、工具和分工，使质量不必完全依赖个人持续加压。",
+              "start": 1180,
+              "end": 1228,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "有效的职业安排会把价值说清楚，也把不包含的部分说清楚；会确认何时算完成，以及新增要求如何重新配置资源。",
+              "start": 1303,
+              "end": 1354,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 7
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "在组织角色上，这一结构既可以成为专业贡献者，也可能承担项目整合、方案判断或连接专业与商业的职责。",
+              "start": 1426,
+              "end": 1474,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 8
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "若角色要求长期吸收模糊责任，却没有相应权限和资源，则容易形成表面职位上升、实际负荷失衡的情况。",
+              "start": 1538,
+              "end": 1585,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 8
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "火在调候上具有温暖候选意义，在职业现实中则可能对应更强的规范、曝光、竞争、时限或责任推动；若基础充足，它可以促成行动与成形，若基础不足，则可能先体现为压力。",
+              "start": 1810,
+              "end": 1888,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 9
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "任何一种五行出现，都不能脱离全局而直接等同于升迁、财富或某项确定事件。",
+              "start": 1888,
+              "end": 1923,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 9
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "事业发展的理想方向，是让敏锐判断不只解决眼前问题，而逐步形成可积累的专业系统。",
+              "start": 1925,
+              "end": 1964,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S04",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 10
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_OPENER",
+        "sectionId": "S05",
+        "pageNumber": 23,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "资源与财富",
+          "en": "Resources and Wealth"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-05-WEALTH.webp",
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "结构真正要求的不是压低输出，而是让每一次输出都由足够的流程、储备和执行能力接住。",
+              "start": 403,
+              "end": 443,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "水的结构显著度使知识、技术、判断、表达与解决问题的能力容易向外流动，再由木财承接为项目、交易、客户需求、可交付成果或具体责任。",
+              "start": 45,
+              "end": 108,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "资源与财富的重点，不在于把财星简单理解为钱财多寡，而在于既有的伤官生财路径能否被稳定承载。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 45,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_DIAGRAM",
+        "sectionId": "S05",
+        "diagramId": "D09",
+        "pageNumber": 24,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "资源与财富",
+          "en": "Resources and Wealth"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_A",
+        "sectionId": "S05",
+        "excerptIndex": 0,
+        "pageNumber": 25,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "资源与财富",
+          "en": "Resources and Wealth"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "月干偏财明透，地支又见正财与偏财暗藏，说明财富议题既有公开可见、需要主动把握的一面，也有嵌在长期安排、细节义务与持续经营之中的一面。",
+              "start": 108,
+              "end": 174,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这一区分尤其重要：收入形成与财富保留并不是同一件事。",
+              "start": 225,
+              "end": 251,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "伤官生财擅长把想法、能力与市场需求连接起来，但日主处于偏弱一侧时，输出越旺，随之而来的交付、管理、沟通和后续责任也越多。",
+              "start": 251,
+              "end": 311,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "比肩多见，使资源运作带有明显的自主性与同层协作色彩。",
+              "start": 445,
+              "end": 471,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "它可以表现为依靠自身判断推进，也可以表现为与伙伴、同业或团队共同调动资源。",
+              "start": 471,
+              "end": 508,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "土印是这一财富结构中更关键的承载条件。",
+              "start": 675,
+              "end": 694,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "土为首要用神、金为辅助，所强调的正是先稳住主体与执行基础，再让输出和财星继续流通。",
+              "start": 874,
+              "end": 915,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "较顺畅的状态则是将价值主张、价格条件、交付范围与后续责任放在同一套安排中，使所得与所担相称，让完成一项安排本身成为财富保留的一部分。",
+              "start": 1102,
+              "end": 1168,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "火若在具体时序中出现，仍须观察它是否有助于整体运行，而非仅凭季节便作吉凶判断。",
+              "start": 1235,
+              "end": 1274,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "同样，水木增强的阶段可能提高表达、交易与资源流动的显著度，同时也会增加交付压力；土金较能发挥作用的阶段，则较有利于整理结构、补充能力与巩固留存。",
+              "start": 1274,
+              "end": 1346,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "能够成立的结论，是不同阶段会改变财富链条中“创造机会”与“承接成果”的相对重点，而最终质量仍取决于二者是否同步。",
+              "start": 1413,
+              "end": 1469,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_B",
+        "sectionId": "S05",
+        "excerptIndex": 1,
+        "pageNumber": 26,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "资源与财富",
+          "en": "Resources and Wealth"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "这里能够确认的是变现通道具有结构基础，却不能据此推定财富规模，更不能把机会出现等同于成果已经留存。",
+              "start": 174,
+              "end": 223,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "若只追求更多项目、更快周转或更广覆盖，表面上的业务增长可能领先于实际承载能力。",
+              "start": 311,
+              "end": 350,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "现实中，这常体现为能够发现机会、提出方案并推动成交，却需要额外处理时间成本、质量控制、履约边界和持续维护。",
+              "start": 350,
+              "end": 403,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "其有利之处在于遇到任务时并非全无支点，能够通过分工、复核和共同执行扩大承载；其压力面则是资源也可能在多人、多项目或多重优先事项之间被分流。",
+              "start": 508,
+              "end": 577,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "比肩并不自动代表竞争或破财，但当权限、成本、收益与责任没有清楚界定时，原本用于支持的协作关系就可能增加协调损耗。",
+              "start": 577,
+              "end": 633,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "反之，规则透明、职责可核验时，共享资源反而能保护伤官生财不因个人负荷过重而失真。",
+              "start": 633,
+              "end": 673,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "若忽略这些不易被看见的成本，便容易把全部注意力放在前端机会，直到履约压力积累后才发现后台不足。",
+              "start": 827,
+              "end": 874,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "于是忙碌可能增加，实际完成度却未同步提升；收入可能形成，留存却被追加投入、协作成本或未结责任消耗。",
+              "start": 967,
+              "end": 1016,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这些都不是必然事件，而是结构在负荷超过承载时的常见方向。",
+              "start": 1074,
+              "end": 1102,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S05",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_OPENER",
+        "sectionId": "S06",
+        "pageNumber": 27,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "关系与亲密模式",
+          "en": "Relationships and Intimacy"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-06-RELATIONSHIP.webp",
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "这里更可靠的阅读，是观察一个人如何把表达、选择与现实责任连接起来。",
+              "start": 42,
+              "end": 75,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "偏财明透而正财暗藏，意味着互动既可能需要灵活回应当下情境，也需要照顾长期承诺、细节秩序与可持续性。",
+              "start": 130,
+              "end": 179,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "日主的承载条件使亲密关系中的“付出”需要特别注意边界。",
+              "start": 649,
+              "end": 676,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_DIAGRAM",
+        "sectionId": "S06",
+        "diagramId": "D10",
+        "pageNumber": 28,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "关系与亲密模式",
+          "en": "Relationships and Intimacy"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_A",
+        "sectionId": "S06",
+        "excerptIndex": 0,
+        "pageNumber": 29,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "关系与亲密模式",
+          "en": "Relationships and Intimacy"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "关系是否顺畅，往往不只取决于心意是否存在，还取决于说出的内容能否转化为双方都能承受的安排。",
+              "start": 179,
+              "end": 224,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "二者结合时，较自然的关系方式是保留各自判断，同时通过坦白沟通建立合作。",
+              "start": 270,
+              "end": 305,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "顺畅表达可以是直接说明需要、讨论现实限制、共同改进生活安排；它并不要求任何一方放弃独立性。",
+              "start": 305,
+              "end": 350,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "反过来，如果表达只剩评判、解释或效率要求，关系便可能听见结论，却感受不到承接过程。",
+              "start": 393,
+              "end": 434,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "申子辰三合水局与寅申冲同时存在，为关系结构增添了一个重要层次：一方面有把经验、信息与共同目标组织起来的能力，另一方面，系统内部仍保留修正、拉动与不同节奏。",
+              "start": 436,
+              "end": 513,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "此时，隐藏负荷未必立即显现，可能先表现为持续协调、反复说明或试图独自把事情处理妥当。",
+              "start": 726,
+              "end": 768,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "比肩较多也使平等成为重要议题。",
+              "start": 871,
+              "end": 886,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "平等运作良好时，双方各自有判断，又愿意共享信息、分担任务并接受复核；运作失衡时，则可能出现每个人都坚持自己的处理方式，或者表面共同承担，实际责任却无人完整承接。",
+              "start": 886,
+              "end": 966,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "财星所代表的现实安排，需要从“愿意做什么”进一步落到“由谁完成、何时完成、完成到什么程度”。",
+              "start": 966,
+              "end": 1012,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这种明确并非削弱亲密，反而能让承诺具有可依赖性。",
+              "start": 1012,
+              "end": 1036,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "对于这一结构而言，可靠的关系不只是情绪浓度高，而是表达、资源与履约能够彼此对应。",
+              "start": 1036,
+              "end": 1076,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "土印与金比劫构成较重要的制衡。",
+              "start": 1078,
+              "end": 1093,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "具体时序会改变关系中哪一层更突出。",
+              "start": 1242,
+              "end": 1259,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_B",
+        "sectionId": "S06",
+        "excerptIndex": 1,
+        "pageNumber": 30,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "关系与亲密模式",
+          "en": "Relationships and Intimacy"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "关系与亲密模式中，财星不能被机械地等同于某一位配偶，也不能由其位置直接推断婚姻事实。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 42,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "既有的伤官生财路径，使关系不只停留在感受或理念层面，而倾向于通过解决问题、落实安排、投入时间与资源来确认价值。",
+              "start": 75,
+              "end": 130,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "伤官带来较强的辨识、表达与修正功能，比肩则强调自主、平等和不愿完全依附于单一权威的倾向。",
+              "start": 226,
+              "end": 270,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "若彼此能够把不同意见当作信息，伤官的敏锐可帮助发现问题，比肩的平等感也能维持相互尊重。",
+              "start": 350,
+              "end": 393,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "冲并没有取消三合，三合也没有消除冲，因此不能把这种并存简单翻译为必然争执、分离或迁移。",
+              "start": 513,
+              "end": 556,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "放在亲密互动中，它更适合被理解为连续性与调整需求同时存在。",
+              "start": 556,
+              "end": 585,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "伤官生财容易以行动、方案和实际承担表达重视，但当外部需求增加时，提供帮助与承担责任可能快于自身恢复。",
+              "start": 676,
+              "end": 726,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "若双方只看见结果，没有看见支持结果所需的时间与资源，原本出于负责的投入便可能转为疲惫。",
+              "start": 768,
+              "end": 811,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "印使关系中的表达不只追求即时反应，还能经过理解、沉淀与复盘；金则帮助主体保持清楚的立场和可执行边界。",
+              "start": 1093,
+              "end": 1143,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "两者足够时，伤官的锋利可以转化为诚实而有建设性的沟通，财星的投入也较不容易变成无止境的责任扩张。",
+              "start": 1143,
+              "end": 1191,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "若火在适当条件下参与，它可能改善整体运行的温度与流通，但仍须结合全局判断。",
+              "start": 1333,
+              "end": 1370,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S06",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_OPENER",
+        "sectionId": "S07",
+        "pageNumber": 31,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "家庭与支持系统",
+          "en": "Family and Support"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-07-HEALTH.webp",
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "前者容易被看见为“有人一起做”，后者则常在事情能够持续运转时才显出价值。",
+              "start": 176,
+              "end": 212,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "其优势是遇到压力时可以调动同层力量，不必把所有责任集中在单一权威或单一照顾者身上；其风险则是，当大家都以为别人也能处理时，责任可能被分散，或者每个人都在付出，却缺乏统一的完成标准。",
+              "start": 636,
+              "end": 726,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "较稳妥的重点，是区分支持从哪里进入结构，以及它以何种方式被感受到。",
+              "start": 42,
+              "end": 75,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_DIAGRAM",
+        "sectionId": "S07",
+        "diagramId": "D11",
+        "pageNumber": 32,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "家庭与支持系统",
+          "en": "Family and Support"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_A",
+        "sectionId": "S07",
+        "excerptIndex": 0,
+        "pageNumber": 33,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "家庭与支持系统",
+          "en": "Family and Support"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "这种配置并不证明现实家庭一定提供了多少帮助，而是说明命理上的承载往往不是单一来源。",
+              "start": 214,
+              "end": 255,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "若只承认显性的行动帮助，便容易忽视那些不醒目却决定长期稳定性的条件。",
+              "start": 376,
+              "end": 410,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "两者并存，意味着整体网络可以成立，却不要求其中每个部分始终同向。",
+              "start": 458,
+              "end": 490,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这不等于家庭冲突已经发生，也不表示任何成员必然远离。",
+              "start": 559,
+              "end": 585,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "它只是提醒，系统的完整性来自协调差异，而不是假设差异不存在。",
+              "start": 585,
+              "end": 615,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "比肩较强的支持方式重视平等与互相承担。",
+              "start": 617,
+              "end": 636,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "共享支持只有在分工、权限和回馈机制清楚时，才真正减少负担。",
+              "start": 726,
+              "end": 755,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "否则，表面上资源很多，实际协调本身也会成为新的任务。",
+              "start": 755,
+              "end": 781,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "如果这些工作长期没有被识别，承担者便可能在外部看来仍然稳定，内部却逐渐失去余量。",
+              "start": 896,
+              "end": 936,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "更完整的状态，是让负责执行的人也获得资源、时间和替补，而不是只在结果出现后才承认其投入。",
+              "start": 1002,
+              "end": 1046,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "金的辅助则使个人边界、职责和决策位置更清晰。",
+              "start": 1099,
+              "end": 1121,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "水木所带来的沟通、流动与现实需求仍可继续展开，但不至于把整个系统推向只有输出、没有补给的状态。",
+              "start": 1182,
+              "end": 1229,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_B",
+        "sectionId": "S07",
+        "excerptIndex": 1,
+        "pageNumber": 34,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "家庭与支持系统",
+          "en": "Family and Support"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "此局的比肩多见于天干并在地支有根，偏印则分布于多个地支而多处于藏干层面，因此支持具有两种不同形态：一类较为可见，来自并肩承担、共同处理和同层协作；另一类较为隐蔽，体现为经验、规则、知识、后勤和稳定基础。",
+              "start": 75,
+              "end": 176,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "可见的比肩支持适合处理即时任务，也能通过分工与互相补位降低个人压力；隐藏的印星支持则更像后台系统，需要时间积累，且未必以直接安慰或公开援助的形式出现。",
+              "start": 255,
+              "end": 330,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "现实中，支持可能存在于一套可沿用的方法、可靠的信息、有人保留的经验，或允许休整和复盘的空间。",
+              "start": 330,
+              "end": 376,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "申子辰形成的整体联系，使支持系统具有组织与串联不同资源的潜力，而寅申冲仍在其中保留调整力量。",
+              "start": 412,
+              "end": 458,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "放在家庭和支持议题上，可以理解为共同目标与个别差异能够同时存在：某些成员或支持渠道适合稳定维持，另一些则可能带来不同方法、节奏或优先次序。",
+              "start": 490,
+              "end": 559,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这里的关键并不是要求某个人承担更多，而是让支持能够抵达具体需要，并且知道何时已经完成。",
+              "start": 781,
+              "end": 824,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "偏印多藏，使隐藏负荷成为另一个重要主题。",
+              "start": 826,
+              "end": 846,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "后台支持往往依靠少数不易被注意的工作维持，例如整理信息、预留资源、处理后续、修正错误或吸收突发变化。",
+              "start": 846,
+              "end": 896,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "伤官生财的运作又会不断把能力引向实际任务，所以家庭或支持网络若持续增加要求，却没有同步补充承载，个人便容易以继续解决问题来回应疲惫。",
+              "start": 936,
+              "end": 1002,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "因而不能指定某年获得援助、离家、组成家庭或发生亲属变化。",
+              "start": 1399,
+              "end": 1427,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S07",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_OPENER",
+        "sectionId": "S08",
+        "pageNumber": 35,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "压力与脆弱点",
+          "en": "Pressure and Vulnerability"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-08-TIMING.webp",
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "这种结构在顺畅状态下，往往表现为能够发现问题、拆解复杂信息，并把想法转成可执行成果。",
+              "start": 177,
+              "end": 219,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "现实中可能呈现为同时处理过多开放事项，频繁切换关注点，或者为了维持推进而过早承诺下一阶段。",
+              "start": 639,
+              "end": 684,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这一命局的压力并不只来自外部任务的多少，更来自输出、落实与承载之间是否保持比例。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 40,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_DIAGRAM",
+        "sectionId": "S08",
+        "diagramId": "D12",
+        "pageNumber": 36,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "压力与脆弱点",
+          "en": "Pressure and Vulnerability"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_A",
+        "sectionId": "S08",
+        "excerptIndex": 0,
+        "pageNumber": 37,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "压力与脆弱点",
+          "en": "Pressure and Vulnerability"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "伤官生财的路径会自然推动思路向表达、解决问题、创造结果与现实兑现延伸；但在日主处于中和偏弱一侧时，每一次继续增加输出、责任或资源调度，都会同步消耗自身的稳定度。",
+              "start": 40,
+              "end": 120,
+              "role": "MECHANISM",
+              "roles": [
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "申子辰水局提高了输出系统的显著度，使思考、表达与流动效率更容易成为结构中的前台功能；寅申冲同时保留内部修正力，意味着推进并非单线展开，而常伴随方向校正、条件变化或不同要求之间的牵动。",
+              "start": 219,
+              "end": 310,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "它描述的是一种动态状态：一方面需要连贯推进，另一方面又必须不断回应局部变化。",
+              "start": 353,
+              "end": 391,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "当承载充足时，这种动态可以形成敏锐、灵活而有结果意识的工作方式。",
+              "start": 393,
+              "end": 425,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "此时，表达不是为了即时释放压力，而是能够服务于完成；资源不是只被启动，还能被保留、整理和继续使用。",
+              "start": 480,
+              "end": 529,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "压力上升后，失真往往出现在“前端很强、后端不足”。",
+              "start": 571,
+              "end": 596,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "它们共同的根源，是输出与现实兑现持续扩张，而支持系统没有同步增加。",
+              "start": 730,
+              "end": 763,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "隐藏的负荷尤其值得重视。",
+              "start": 765,
+              "end": 777,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "偏印多藏于地支，说明支持条件虽存在，却未必总是直接显露在表层。",
+              "start": 777,
+              "end": 808,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "结构可能具有学习、整理、吸收经验与建立框架的能力，但这些能力需要时间和空间才能发挥。",
+              "start": 808,
+              "end": 850,
+              "role": "LIVED_EXPRESSION",
+              "roles": [
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "由此形成的脆弱点，不是缺乏能力，而是能力长期被用于交付，却少有机会回补自身。",
+              "start": 899,
+              "end": 937,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_B",
+        "sectionId": "S08",
+        "excerptIndex": 1,
+        "pageNumber": 38,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "压力与脆弱点",
+          "en": "Pressure and Vulnerability"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "因而，真正需要留意的并不是“能不能做”，而是做得越多以后，是否仍有足够的印比承接后续维护、反复修订与长期责任。",
+              "start": 120,
+              "end": 175,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "三合与冲并存，不能简单解释为一种力量胜过另一种力量，更不能直接对应某项已经发生的冲突。",
+              "start": 310,
+              "end": 353,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "土所代表的扶身与承载能够帮助输出沉淀为方法、秩序和可重复的流程，金的比劫支持则有助于维持立场、边界与持续执行。",
+              "start": 425,
+              "end": 480,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "责任分配清楚、协作支持真实存在时，结构中的流动性便较容易转化为效率，而不是消耗。",
+              "start": 529,
+              "end": 569,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "思考和回应仍可快速运作，新的安排也可能持续进入，但恢复、归档、复核和长期维护逐渐落后。",
+              "start": 596,
+              "end": 639,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这里不能据命局断定具体行为一定发生；更准确地说，这些是结构在承载不足时较容易出现的风险形态。",
+              "start": 684,
+              "end": 730,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY",
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "如果外部只看见即时产出，而没有为准备、复盘和恢复留下位置，原本可以提供支撑的部分便不容易充分介入。",
+              "start": 850,
+              "end": 899,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "火的出现不应被笼统理解为越多越好；如果只有加速和催动，而土金承载没有跟上，反而可能令已经活跃的输出承担更多压力。",
+              "start": 987,
+              "end": 1043,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "相反，当节奏、规则和支持先行建立时，适度的火性条件才更可能发挥温暖与推动作用。",
+              "start": 1043,
+              "end": 1082,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "压力管理的核心因此不是压低表达或回避成果，而是让学习、准备、边界、协作与恢复成为产出机制的一部分，使伤官生财不止能够启动，也能够被长期承受。",
+              "start": 1082,
+              "end": 1152,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_OPENER",
+        "sectionId": "S09",
+        "pageNumber": 39,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "长期周期与转折模式",
+          "en": "Long-Term Cycles and Turning Points"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-09-GUIDANCE.webp",
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "长期周期的作用，不是替原局重新定义一个命运，而是在不同阶段改变哪些结构功能更容易被调用、哪些环节需要承担更大负荷。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 57,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "两者的意义并不是让结构停下来，而是让原本活跃的输出具有保存、复核和延续的条件。",
+              "start": 267,
+              "end": 306,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "从长期功能看，土的阶段性加强较有利于建立承载层，使经验、知识和已经展开的事务能够形成制度、程序与可持续的基础。",
+              "start": 188,
+              "end": 243,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_DIAGRAM",
+        "sectionId": "S09",
+        "diagramId": "D13",
+        "pageNumber": 40,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "长期周期与转折模式",
+          "en": "Long-Term Cycles and Turning Points"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_A",
+        "sectionId": "S09",
+        "excerptIndex": 0,
+        "pageNumber": 41,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "长期周期与转折模式",
+          "en": "Long-Term Cycles and Turning Points"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "金的支持则更接近巩固主体性、执行连续性和边界感。",
+              "start": 243,
+              "end": 267,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "若周期中土金得到适当体现，转折常首先发生在运作方式上：安排变得更可重复，责任边界更明确，资源不再只用于启动，也能用于维护。",
+              "start": 306,
+              "end": 367,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "至于现实中会落在哪个领域，仍须结合具体生活资料，不能由命局单独指定。",
+              "start": 367,
+              "end": 401,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "相对地，当某一阶段进一步强化流动、表达、目标展开或现实兑现时，原有路径可能更容易显现，但“更容易发动”并不等于“无条件更有利”。",
+              "start": 403,
+              "end": 467,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "如果支持同步存在，活跃度可以转化为学习成果、解决方案和可落实的安排；如果支持不足，同样的活跃度便可能增加开放事项、协作成本和后续维护。",
+              "start": 467,
+              "end": 534,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "长期周期中的关键差别，往往不是有没有机会启动，而是启动之后是否有能力保留成果，并为已经形成的安排负责。",
+              "start": 534,
+              "end": 585,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "火在长期时序中的作用需要单独看待。",
+              "start": 587,
+              "end": 604,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "因此，长期周期中的“转暖”与“变得更有利”不是同义词，仍须查看整体配合。",
+              "start": 727,
+              "end": 763,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "地支关系会使某些转折呈现为结构重组，而不只是力量增减。",
+              "start": 765,
+              "end": 792,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_B",
+        "sectionId": "S09",
+        "excerptIndex": 1,
+        "pageNumber": 42,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "长期周期与转折模式",
+          "en": "Long-Term Cycles and Turning Points"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "原局的基本路径保持不变，大运与流年所做的是调整其显著度、速度与承载条件。",
+              "start": 57,
+              "end": 93,
+              "role": "TIMING",
+              "roles": [
+                "TIMING",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "因此，判断转折时不能只看某一五行出现，也不能把一段大运直接等同于成功、阻碍或某类固定事件；真正需要观察的是，新增力量究竟补足了原有路径，还是令输出与兑现进一步超过日主所能稳定承受的范围。",
+              "start": 93,
+              "end": 186,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "它是冬令背景下的调候候选，可以带来温暖、启动与显化，但不能据此覆盖扶抑与格局层面对土金承载的优先判断。",
+              "start": 604,
+              "end": 655,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "原局中的三合与冲同时存在，所以后续大运、流年再次触及相关成员时，可能提高整合、流动、修正或牵动的显著度。",
+              "start": 792,
+              "end": 844,
+              "role": "TIMING",
+              "roles": [
+                "TIMING",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这里的转折首先是命理结构中的重点移动，不能直接翻译为迁移、人际破裂或其他具体事件。",
+              "start": 844,
+              "end": 885,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "合不必然意味着顺利，冲也不必然意味着损失；它们分别提示连接、重组、位移或修正的可能机制，实际表现仍取决于承载条件以及现实情境。",
+              "start": 885,
+              "end": 948,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "由此看，较可靠的长期判断方式，是把每一阶段放回“输出—兑现—承载”的完整链条中。",
+              "start": 950,
+              "end": 990,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "周期若补足后端，重点可以从不断启动转向沉淀、整合和持续；周期若加强前端，则需要更严格地核对时间、支持和责任容量；周期若同时引动多组关系，转折可能表现为旧安排需要重新协调，而不是简单的吉凶翻转。",
+              "start": 990,
+              "end": 1086,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "由于没有提供完整的大运序列、起运时间与对应年龄，本节不指定人生阶段，也不排列固定年份。",
+              "start": 1086,
+              "end": 1129,
+              "role": "TIMING",
+              "roles": [
+                "TIMING",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "可以确定的只是：长期变化会改变结构重点，却不会取消原局对承载与制衡的持续要求。",
+              "start": 1129,
+              "end": 1168,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_OPENER",
+        "sectionId": "S10",
+        "pageNumber": 43,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "当前时序",
+          "en": "Current Timing"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-10-APPENDIX.webp",
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "合说明两者之间产生连接与牵制，不等于已经完成五行转化；现有资料也没有给出化合结论。",
+              "start": 182,
+              "end": 223,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "它与原局申构成六合兼破，与原局寅构成害，并参与寅巳申刑。",
+              "start": 401,
+              "end": 429,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "此时序所呈现的重点，并不是单一力量的到来，而是支持、调候与多重地支关系同时被引动，结构的活跃度和协调要求都会上升。",
+              "start": 83,
+              "end": 140,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        }
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "SECTION_DIAGRAM",
+        "sectionId": "S10",
+        "diagramId": "D14",
+        "pageNumber": 44,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "当前时序",
+          "en": "Current Timing"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_A",
+        "sectionId": "S10",
+        "excerptIndex": 0,
+        "pageNumber": 45,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "当前时序",
+          "en": "Current Timing"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "当前所给时序为己巳大运、丙寅流年，但其公历年份、年龄与起止日期均未提供，因此只能讨论这一组干支如何作用于原局，不能把它安放到确定的人生时间点，也不能据此断言具体事件。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 83,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "因此，己土不能被当作毫无条件、完全独立的支持来理解。",
+              "start": 223,
+              "end": 249,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "更合适的说法是：承载、整理与稳定的需求进入前台，同时又与原有的现实展开路径相互缠连。",
+              "start": 249,
+              "end": 291,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "合、破、害、刑同时出现，表示连接、调整、隐性牵动与结构摩擦并存。",
+              "start": 429,
+              "end": 461,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "丙寅流年进一步提高火与寅的显著度。",
+              "start": 542,
+              "end": 559,
+              "role": "TIMING",
+              "roles": [
+                "TIMING",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这里所说的是结构压力的集中，而不是对迁移、人际冲突、健康或其他事件的预测。",
+              "start": 662,
+              "end": 699,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "寅申冲也不会取消原有三合，原有三合更不会抹去当前被强化的冲；两种机制仍须并读。",
+              "start": 699,
+              "end": 738,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "但这需要土的承接真正进入执行层面，也需要金所代表的边界与持续性没有被过度消耗。",
+              "start": 810,
+              "end": 849,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "若规则清楚、职责有限、复核机制存在，多重引动可以表现为密集而有效的调整，使旧安排得到更新，新要求被纳入可管理的秩序。",
+              "start": 849,
+              "end": 907,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "此时最需要观察的，不是机会数量，而是每一项安排是否有明确负责人、可用资源、完成标准与退出条件。",
+              "start": 1028,
+              "end": 1075,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTERPRETATION_B",
+        "sectionId": "S10",
+        "excerptIndex": 1,
+        "pageNumber": 46,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "当前时序",
+          "en": "Current Timing"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "大运天干己土进入，表面上与原局所需的承载方向相呼应，但己与原局月干甲形成甲己合。",
+              "start": 142,
+              "end": 182,
+              "role": "TIMING",
+              "roles": [
+                "TIMING",
+                "MECHANISM",
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "现实层面可能更强调如何把已经启动的事项纳入规则、期限和责任结构，但是否真正减轻负担，仍取决于支持能否落实，而不只是名义上存在。",
+              "start": 291,
+              "end": 354,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "大运地支巳带来火的调候意味，为冬令背景增加温暖与启动条件；然而巳并非只发挥单纯的温暖作用。",
+              "start": 356,
+              "end": 401,
+              "role": "TIMING",
+              "roles": [
+                "TIMING",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 2
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "年度寅重复原局寅，又冲原局申，并与大运巳相害，同时继续强化寅巳申刑的关系网络。",
+              "start": 559,
+              "end": 598,
+              "role": "TIMING",
+              "roles": [
+                "TIMING",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "这种重复和多重触发，会使“调整中的调整”成为当期的重要特征：一项安排在推进时，可能同时受到旧结构、当前周期和年度要求的共同牵引。",
+              "start": 598,
+              "end": 662,
+              "role": "TIMING",
+              "roles": [
+                "TIMING"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 3
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "在较顺畅的表现中，己土的承载倾向可以帮助整理流程，巳、丙之火则可能提供温度、可见度与行动动力，使原本活跃的表达与兑现路径更容易形成明确节奏。",
+              "start": 740,
+              "end": 810,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "MECHANISM"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 4
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "压力下的失真则可能来自同时把“支持出现”和“承载已经完成”视为同一件事。",
+              "start": 909,
+              "end": 945,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "甲己合使支持与现实目标之间存在牵连，巳与申、寅之间的多重关系又增加协调复杂度；若再因丙寅的推动而持续加快，容易出现前端行动明显增强，而后端整理、确认与恢复不足的局面。",
+              "start": 945,
+              "end": 1028,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+                "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "共享支持若只是口头存在，隐藏负荷仍可能集中于个人；相反，若协作能够实际分担维护和复核，这段时序的活跃度才较容易转化为可持续成果。",
+              "start": 1075,
+              "end": 1139,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 5
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "因此，当前时序的核心是“在加速与重组中建立承载”。",
+              "start": 1141,
+              "end": 1166,
+              "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
+              "roles": [
+                "COUNTERWEIGHT"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "由于没有公历年份、年龄及事件资料，本节不延伸到具体预测。",
+              "start": 1232,
+              "end": 1260,
+              "role": "BOUNDARY",
+              "roles": [
+                "BOUNDARY"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 6
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": []
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "INTEGRATED_MAP",
+        "diagramId": "D15",
+        "pageNumber": 47,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "八字整合运行图",
+          "en": "Integrated BaZi Map"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": null,
+        "insightCards": null
+      },
+      {
+        "role": "CLOSING_REALITY_BRIDGE",
+        "pageNumber": 48,
+        "title": {
+          "zh": "把解读带回生活",
+          "en": "Bring the Reading into Life"
+        },
+        "staticAsset": null,
+        "staticFolioMasks": [],
+        "bodyAsset": "https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp",
+        "sectionMasterAsset": null,
+        "content": {
+          "zh-Hans": [
+            {
+              "text": "这种结构在顺畅状态下，往往表现为能够发现问题、拆解复杂信息，并把想法转成可执行成果。",
+              "start": 177,
+              "end": 219,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S08",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "长期周期的作用，不是替原局重新定义一个命运，而是在不同阶段改变哪些结构功能更容易被调用、哪些环节需要承担更大负荷。",
+              "start": 0,
+              "end": 57,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S09",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 0
+            },
+            {
+              "text": "合说明两者之间产生连接与牵制，不等于已经完成五行转化；现有资料也没有给出化合结论。",
+              "start": 182,
+              "end": 223,
+              "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
+              "roles": [
+                "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
+              ],
+              "sectionId": "S10",
+              "locale": "zh-Hans",
+              "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
+              "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
+              "paragraphIndex": 1
+            }
+          ],
+          "en": [
+            null,
+            null,
+            null
+          ]
+        },
+        "insightCards": null
+      }
+    ],
