19.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">正财</tspan></text><text x="360" y="340.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Direct Wealth</tspan></text><text x="360" y="388.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">乙</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="hidden2"><rect x="477.5" y="297.5" width="195" height="105" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="575" y="319.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="575" dy="0">伤官</tspan></text><text x="575" y="340.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="575" dy="0">Hurting Officer</tspan></text><text x="575" y="388.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="575" dy="0">癸</tspan></text></g></svg><figcaption><p lang="zh-Hans">连线表达结构或功能路径，不代表事件因果或必然结果。</p><p lang="en">Connectors describe structural or functional paths, not event causation or guaranteed outcomes.</p></figcaption></figure></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>28 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="29" data-page-role="INTERPRETATION_A" data-section-id="S06"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>关系与亲密模式<small lang="en">Relationships and Intimacy</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div lang="zh-Hans" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="179" data-source-end="224" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">关系是否顺畅，往往不只取决于心意是否存在，还取决于说出的内容能否转化为双方都能承受的安排。</p><p data-source-start="270" data-source-end="305" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">二者结合时，较自然的关系方式是保留各自判断，同时通过坦白沟通建立合作。</p><p data-source-start="305" data-source-end="350" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">顺畅表达可以是直接说明需要、讨论现实限制、共同改进生活安排；它并不要求任何一方放弃独立性。</p><p data-source-start="393" data-source-end="434" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">反过来，如果表达只剩评判、解释或效率要求，关系便可能听见结论，却感受不到承接过程。</p><p data-source-start="871" data-source-end="886" data-source-role="MECHANISM">比肩较多也使平等成为重要议题。</p><p data-source-start="1012" data-source-end="1036" data-source-role="LIVED_EXPRESSION">这种明确并非削弱亲密，反而能让承诺具有可依赖性。</p><p data-source-start="1078" data-source-end="1093" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">土印与金比劫构成较重要的制衡。</p><p data-source-start="1242" data-source-end="1259" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">具体时序会改变关系中哪一层更突出。</p></div><div lang="en" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="686" data-source-end="843" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Relational ease therefore depends not only on whether care is present, but on whether what is expressed can become an arrangement that both people can carry.</p><p data-source-start="943" data-source-end="1041" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">The repeated Companion influence places autonomy, equality, and independent judgment alongside it.</p><p data-source-start="1042" data-source-end="1209" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Their constructive combination favors candid cooperation: each person can retain a point of view while discussing needs, constraints, and possible improvements openly.</p><p data-source-start="1357" data-source-end="1468" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Under strain, however, communication may become dominated by conclusions, critique, explanation, or efficiency.</p><p data-source-start="3566" data-source-end="3638" data-source-role="LIVED_EXPRESSION">Such precision does not reduce intimacy; it makes commitment dependable.</p><p data-source-start="3915" data-source-end="3981" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Metal helps maintain a clear standpoint and executable boundaries.</p></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>29 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="30" data-page-role="INTERPRETATION_B" data-section-id="S06"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>关系与亲密模式<small lang="en">Relationships and Intimacy</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div lang="zh-Hans" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="0" data-source-end="42" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">关系与亲密模式中，财星不能被机械地等同于某一位配偶，也不能由其位置直接推断婚姻事实。</p><p data-source-start="436" data-source-end="513" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">申子辰三合水局与寅申冲同时存在，为关系结构增添了一个重要层次：一方面有把经验、信息与共同目标组织起来的能力，另一方面，系统内部仍保留修正、拉动与不同节奏。</p><p data-source-start="726" data-source-end="768" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">此时，隐藏负荷未必立即显现，可能先表现为持续协调、反复说明或试图独自把事情处理妥当。</p><p data-source-start="886" data-source-end="966" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">平等运作良好时，双方各自有判断，又愿意共享信息、分担任务并接受复核；运作失衡时，则可能出现每个人都坚持自己的处理方式，或者表面共同承担，实际责任却无人完整承接。</p></div><div lang="en" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="1469" data-source-end="1596" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">The content may be accurate, yet the other person may experience little room for the process by which understanding is reached.</p><p data-source-start="1598" data-source-end="1696" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">The coexistence of the Water Three Harmony and the Yin–Shen clash adds an important qualification.</p><p data-source-start="1697" data-source-end="1869" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">There is capacity to organize information, experience, and shared aims into a larger continuity, while an internal source of adjustment and divergent rhythm remains active.</p><p data-source-start="1870" data-source-end="1950" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">The clash does not cancel the harmony, and the harmony does not erase the clash.</p><p data-source-start="1951" data-source-end="2080" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">It would therefore be unsound to translate this configuration directly into quarrels, separation, relocation, or any other event.</p><p data-source-start="2827" data-source-end="2879" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">This does not prove that either party will overgive.</p><p data-source-start="3746" data-source-end="3819" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">Earth Resource and Metal Companion provide the main balancing conditions.</p></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>30 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="31" data-page-role="SECTION_OPENER" data-section-id="S07"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-07-HEALTH.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>家庭与支持系统<small lang="en">Family and Support</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div class="bdm-insights"><div><b>01</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="176" data-source-end="212" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">前者容易被看见为“有人一起做”，后者则常在事情能够持续运转时才显出价值。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="598" data-source-end="714" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">The other is quieter and infrastructural, taking the form of knowledge, precedent, rules, logistics, and continuity.</p></div><div><b>02</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="636" data-source-end="726" data-source-role="LIVED_EXPRESSION">其优势是遇到压力时可以调动同层力量，不必把所有责任集中在单一权威或单一照顾者身上；其风险则是，当大家都以为别人也能处理时，责任可能被分散，或者每个人都在付出，却缺乏统一的完成标准。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="472" data-source-end="597" data-source-role="LIVED_EXPRESSION">One is visible and lateral, operating through shared effort, practical cooperation, and people working alongside one another.</p></div><div><b>03</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="42" data-source-end="75" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">较稳妥的重点，是区分支持从哪里进入结构，以及它以何种方式被感受到。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="177" data-source-end="269" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">The sounder question is how support enters the structure and in what form it becomes usable.</p></div></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>31 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="32" data-page-role="SECTION_DIAGRAM" data-section-id="S07"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>家庭与支持系统<small lang="en">Family and Support</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><figure data-diagram-id="D11" data-visual-grammar="FAMILY_NETWORK" class=""><svg viewBox="0 0 720 540" role="img" aria-label="家庭与支持"><title>家庭与支持</title><defs><marker id="arrow-D11" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7" fill="#947439"/></marker></defs><g data-edge-from="year" data-edge-to="resource" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 176 127 L 304 223" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D11)"/></g><g data-edge-from="day" data-edge-to="resource" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 360 155 L 360 195" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D11)"/></g><g data-edge-from="hour" data-edge-to="resource" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 544 127 L 416 223" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D11)"/></g><g data-edge-from="resource" data-edge-to="shared" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 360 335 L 360 365" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D11)"/></g><g data-node-id="year"><rect x="22.5" y="35" width="195" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="120" y="57" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="120" dy="0">年柱</tspan></text><text x="120" y="78" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="120" dy="0">Year</tspan></text><text x="120" y="121" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="120" dy="0">庚申</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="day"><rect x="262.5" y="35" width="195" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="57" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">日柱</tspan></text><text x="360" y="78" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Day</tspan></text><text x="360" y="121" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">庚辰</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="hour"><rect x="502.5" y="35" width="195" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="600" y="57" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="600" dy="0">时柱</tspan></text><text x="600" y="78" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="600" dy="0">Hour</tspan></text><text x="600" y="121" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="600" dy="0">庚寅</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="resource"><rect x="262.5" y="215" width="195" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="237" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">偏印支持</tspan></text><text x="360" y="258" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Indirect Resource</tspan></text><text x="360" y="301" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">戊</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="shared"><rect x="262.5" y="385" width="195" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="407" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">共同承载</tspan></text><text x="360" y="428" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Shared support</tspan></text><text x="360" y="471" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">印比支持</tspan></text></g></svg><figcaption><p lang="zh-Hans">连线表达结构或功能路径，不代表事件因果或必然结果。</p><p lang="en">Connectors describe structural or functional paths, not event causation or guaranteed outcomes.</p></figcaption></figure></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>32 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="33" data-page-role="INTERPRETATION_A" data-section-id="S07"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>家庭与支持系统<small lang="en">Family and Support</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div lang="zh-Hans" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="376" data-source-end="410" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">若只承认显性的行动帮助，便容易忽视那些不醒目却决定长期稳定性的条件。</p><p data-source-start="458" data-source-end="490" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">两者并存，意味着整体网络可以成立，却不要求其中每个部分始终同向。</p><p data-source-start="559" data-source-end="585" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">这不等于家庭冲突已经发生，也不表示任何成员必然远离。</p><p data-source-start="585" data-source-end="615" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">它只是提醒，系统的完整性来自协调差异，而不是假设差异不存在。</p><p data-source-start="617" data-source-end="636" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">比肩较强的支持方式重视平等与互相承担。</p><p data-source-start="755" data-source-end="781" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">否则，表面上资源很多，实际协调本身也会成为新的任务。</p><p data-source-start="896" data-source-end="936" data-source-role="LIVED_EXPRESSION">如果这些工作长期没有被识别，承担者便可能在外部看来仍然稳定，内部却逐渐失去余量。</p><p data-source-start="1099" data-source-end="1121" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">金的辅助则使个人边界、职责和决策位置更清晰。</p></div><div lang="en" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="715" data-source-end="869" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">The first is easy to recognize as someone helping with a task; the second often becomes apparent only because the whole arrangement continues to function.</p><p data-source-start="871" data-source-end="939" data-source-role="LIVED_EXPRESSION">This does not establish how much help an actual family has provided.</p><p data-source-start="940" data-source-end="1044" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">It shows instead that carrying capacity is structurally distributed rather than derived from one source.</p><p data-source-start="1252" data-source-end="1384" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">It can reside in a reusable method, reliable information, retained experience, material reserves, or permission to pause and review.</p><p data-source-start="1927" data-source-end="2031" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Some channels may be suited to continuity, while others introduce a different method, pace, or priority.</p><p data-source-start="2206" data-source-end="2280" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">A Companion-based support style values equality and shared responsibility.</p></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>33 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="34" data-page-role="INTERPRETATION_B" data-section-id="S07"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>家庭与支持系统<small lang="en">Family and Support</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div lang="zh-Hans" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="826" data-source-end="846" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">偏印多藏，使隐藏负荷成为另一个重要主题。</p><p data-source-start="1002" data-source-end="1046" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">更完整的状态，是让负责执行的人也获得资源、时间和替补，而不是只在结果出现后才承认其投入。</p><p data-source-start="1182" data-source-end="1229" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">水木所带来的沟通、流动与现实需求仍可继续展开，但不至于把整个系统推向只有输出、没有补给的状态。</p><p data-source-start="1372" data-source-end="1400" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">因而不能指定某年获得援助、离家、组成家庭或发生亲属变化。</p></div><div lang="en" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="430" data-source-end="471" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">Support therefore has two distinct modes.</p><p data-source-start="2032" data-source-end="2093" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">This does not prove family conflict, distance, or separation.</p><p data-source-start="2094" data-source-end="2204" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">It indicates that cohesion depends on coordinating differences rather than assuming that no differences exist.</p><p data-source-start="2281" data-source-end="2432" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Its strength is that pressure need not be placed entirely on one authority figure or caretaker; peer-level capacity can be mobilized when demands rise.</p><p data-source-start="2433" data-source-end="2590" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Its weakness appears when everyone assumes that someone else can handle the matter, or when many people contribute without a common definition of completion.</p><p data-source-start="2779" data-source-end="2951" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">The aim is not to make one person carry more, but to ensure that help reaches a specific need and that all parties know when the responsibility has actually been fulfilled.</p><p data-source-start="3958" data-source-end="4037" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Metal adds clearer personal boundaries, responsibility, and decision authority.</p></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>34 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="35" data-page-role="SECTION_OPENER" data-section-id="S08"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-08-TIMING.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>压力与脆弱点<small lang="en">Pressure and Vulnerability</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div class="bdm-insights"><div><b>01</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="177" data-source-end="219" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">这种结构在顺畅状态下，往往表现为能够发现问题、拆解复杂信息，并把想法转成可执行成果。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="0" data-source-end="87" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">The principal vulnerability in this chart is not simply the volume of external demands.</p></div><div><b>02</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="639" data-source-end="684" data-source-role="LIVED_EXPRESSION">现实中可能呈现为同时处理过多开放事项，频繁切换关注点，或者为了维持推进而过早承诺下一阶段。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="2833" data-source-end="2993" data-source-role="LIVED_EXPRESSION">The structure therefore has access to learning, synthesis, accumulated experience, and framework-building, but those functions require protected time and space.</p></div><div><b>03</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="0" data-source-end="40" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">这一命局的压力并不只来自外部任务的多少，更来自输出、落实与承载之间是否保持比例。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="88" data-source-end="183" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">It lies in whether expression, practical delivery, and structural support remain proportionate.</p></div></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>35 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="36" data-page-role="SECTION_DIAGRAM" data-section-id="S08"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>压力与脆弱点<small lang="en">Pressure and Vulnerability</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><figure data-diagram-id="D12" data-visual-grammar="RECOVERY_PATH" class=""><svg viewBox="0 0 720 590" role="img" aria-label="压力与承载"><title>压力与承载</title><defs><marker id="arrow-D12" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7" fill="#947439"/></marker></defs><g data-edge-from="output" data-edge-to="pressure" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 360 101 L 360 121" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D12)"/></g><g data-edge-from="pressure" data-edge-to="day" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 360 212 L 360 232" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D12)"/></g><g data-edge-from="day" data-edge-to="resource" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 360 323 L 360 343" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D12)"/></g><g data-edge-from="resource" data-edge-to="recovery" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 360 434 L 360 454" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D12)"/></g><g data-node-id="output"><rect x="205" y="14" width="310" height="88" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="36" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">食神 · 伤官</tspan></text><text x="360" y="57" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Eating God · Hurting Officer</tspan></text><text x="360" y="88" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">壬 / 癸</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="pressure"><rect x="205" y="125" width="310" height="88" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="147" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">七杀责任</tspan></text><text x="360" y="168" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Seven Killings</tspan></text><text x="360" y="199" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">丙</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="day"><rect x="205" y="236" width="310" height="88" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="258" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">日主</tspan></text><text x="360" y="279" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Day Master</tspan></text><text x="360" y="310" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">庚</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="resource"><rect x="205" y="347" width="310" height="88" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="369" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">偏印支持</tspan></text><text x="360" y="390" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Indirect Resource</tspan></text><text x="360" y="421" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">戊</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="recovery"><rect x="205" y="458" width="310" height="88" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="480" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">恢复与收束</tspan></text><text x="360" y="501" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Recovery and closure</tspan></text><text x="360" y="532" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">印比承载</tspan></text></g></svg><figcaption><p lang="zh-Hans">连线表达结构或功能路径，不代表事件因果或必然结果。</p><p lang="en">Connectors describe structural or functional paths, not event causation or guaranteed outcomes.</p></figcaption></figure></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>36 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="37" data-page-role="INTERPRETATION_A" data-section-id="S08"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>压力与脆弱点<small lang="en">Pressure and Vulnerability</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div lang="zh-Hans" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="219" data-source-end="310" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">申子辰水局提高了输出系统的显著度，使思考、表达与流动效率更容易成为结构中的前台功能；寅申冲同时保留内部修正力，意味着推进并非单线展开，而常伴随方向校正、条件变化或不同要求之间的牵动。</p><p data-source-start="353" data-source-end="391" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">它描述的是一种动态状态：一方面需要连贯推进，另一方面又必须不断回应局部变化。</p><p data-source-start="393" data-source-end="425" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">当承载充足时，这种动态可以形成敏锐、灵活而有结果意识的工作方式。</p><p data-source-start="571" data-source-end="596" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">压力上升后，失真往往出现在“前端很强、后端不足”。</p><p data-source-start="765" data-source-end="777" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">隐藏的负荷尤其值得重视。</p><p data-source-start="777" data-source-end="808" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">偏印多藏于地支，说明支持条件虽存在，却未必总是直接显露在表层。</p></div><div lang="en" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="184" data-source-end="314" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">The established pathway naturally carries ideas toward articulation, problem-solving, tangible output, and real-world application.</p><p data-source-start="720" data-source-end="856" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">When functioning smoothly, this structure can identify problems, organize complex information, and convert thought into usable outcomes.</p><p data-source-start="857" data-source-end="1010" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">The Water configuration gives the output system considerable prominence, while the simultaneous Yin–Shen clash preserves an internal force of adjustment.</p><p data-source-start="2505" data-source-end="2548" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">These are not fixed behavioral predictions.</p><p data-source-start="2681" data-source-end="2724" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Hidden load is particularly important here.</p><p data-source-start="3541" data-source-end="3579" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">More Fire is not automatically better.</p></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>37 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="38" data-page-role="INTERPRETATION_B" data-section-id="S08"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>压力与脆弱点<small lang="en">Pressure and Vulnerability</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div lang="zh-Hans" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="40" data-source-end="120" data-source-role="MECHANISM">伤官生财的路径会自然推动思路向表达、解决问题、创造结果与现实兑现延伸；但在日主处于中和偏弱一侧时，每一次继续增加输出、责任或资源调度，都会同步消耗自身的稳定度。</p><p data-source-start="310" data-source-end="353" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">三合与冲并存，不能简单解释为一种力量胜过另一种力量，更不能直接对应某项已经发生的冲突。</p><p data-source-start="480" data-source-end="529" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">此时，表达不是为了即时释放压力，而是能够服务于完成；资源不是只被启动，还能被保留、整理和继续使用。</p><p data-source-start="730" data-source-end="763" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">它们共同的根源，是输出与现实兑现持续扩张，而支持系统没有同步增加。</p><p data-source-start="899" data-source-end="937" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">由此形成的脆弱点，不是缺乏能力，而是能力长期被用于交付，却少有机会回补自身。</p></div><div lang="en" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="1011" data-source-end="1160" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Progress is therefore not necessarily linear: continuity may coexist with changing conditions, competing requirements, or repeated course correction.</p><p data-source-start="1161" data-source-end="1304" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Neither the combination nor the clash cancels the other, and their coexistence should not be translated into a predetermined conflict or event.</p><p data-source-start="1305" data-source-end="1414" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">It describes a dynamic operating environment in which sustained flow and local correction are both necessary.</p><p data-source-start="1416" data-source-end="1526" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">With adequate carrying capacity, this can become an alert, flexible, and result-conscious mode of functioning.</p><p data-source-start="1646" data-source-end="1745" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Metal provides secondary reinforcement through steadiness, boundaries, and the ability to continue.</p><p data-source-start="3460" data-source-end="3540" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">It must not, however, be silently merged with the Earth-and-Metal support logic.</p><p data-source-start="4025" data-source-end="4126" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">That is what allows the chart’s productive pathway not only to begin, but also to remain sustainable.</p></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>38 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="39" data-page-role="SECTION_OPENER" data-section-id="S09"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-09-GUIDANCE.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>长期周期与转折模式<small lang="en">Long-Term Cycles and Turning Points</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div class="bdm-insights"><div><b>01</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="0" data-source-end="57" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">长期周期的作用，不是替原局重新定义一个命运，而是在不同阶段改变哪些结构功能更容易被调用、哪些环节需要承担更大负荷。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="0" data-source-end="71" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Long-term cycles do not replace the natal structure with a new destiny.</p></div><div><b>02</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="267" data-source-end="306" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">两者的意义并不是让结构停下来，而是让原本活跃的输出具有保存、复核和延续的条件。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="1797" data-source-end="1901" data-source-role="LIVED_EXPRESSION">Without it, the same activity can multiply open commitments, coordination costs, and maintenance duties.</p></div><div><b>03</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="188" data-source-end="243" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">从长期功能看，土的阶段性加强较有利于建立承载层，使经验、知识和已经展开的事务能够形成制度、程序与可持续的基础。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="867" data-source-end="985" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">Metal offers a different but related form of support through continuity, boundaries, and a firmer center of execution.</p></div></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>39 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="40" data-page-role="SECTION_DIAGRAM" data-section-id="S09"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>长期周期与转折模式<small lang="en">Long-Term Cycles and Turning Points</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><figure data-diagram-id="D13" data-visual-grammar="FUNCTION_CYCLE" class=""><svg viewBox="0 0 720 540" role="img" aria-label="长期功能周期"><title>长期功能周期</title><defs><marker id="arrow-D13" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7" fill="#947439"/></marker></defs><g data-edge-from="peer" data-edge-to="output" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 420.093870143242 110.89884080589746 L 513.8938460231675 166.93301523473727" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D13)"/></g><g data-edge-from="output" data-edge-to="wealth" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 548.2615163856253 267.93302841747584 L 517.9778815465907 344.56697158252416" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D13)"/></g><g data-edge-from="wealth" data-edge-to="pressure" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 422.25168176580644 409.66814395936524 L 297.74831823419356 409.66814395936524" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D13)"/></g><g data-edge-from="pressure" data-edge-to="resource" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 202.0221184534093 344.56697158252416 L 171.7384836143747 267.93302841747584" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D13)"/></g><g data-edge-from="resource" data-edge-to="peer" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 206.10615397683242 166.9330152347373 L 299.906129856758 110.89884080589746" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D13)"/></g><g data-node-id="peer"><rect x="262.5" y="25" width="195" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="47" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">比肩</tspan></text><text x="360" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Peer</tspan></text><text x="360" y="111" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">庚</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="output"><rect x="476.48771616640954" y="152.83185604063473" width="195" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="573.9877161664095" y="174.83185604063473" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="573.9877161664095" dy="0">食神 · 伤官</tspan></text><text x="573.9877161664095" y="195.83185604063473" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="573.9877161664095" dy="0">Eating God ·</tspan><tspan x="573.9877161664095" dy="19">Hurting Officer</tspan></text><text x="573.9877161664095" y="238.83185604063473" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="573.9877161664095" dy="0">壬 / 癸</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="wealth"><rect x="394.75168176580644" y="359.66814395936524" width="195" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="492.25168176580644" y="381.66814395936524" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="492.25168176580644" dy="0">偏财 · 正财</tspan></text><text x="492.25168176580644" y="402.66814395936524" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="492.25168176580644" dy="0">Indirect · Direct</tspan><tspan x="492.25168176580644" dy="19">Wealth</tspan></text><text x="492.25168176580644" y="445.66814395936524" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="492.25168176580644" dy="0">甲 / 乙</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="pressure"><rect x="130.24831823419356" y="359.66814395936524" width="195" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="227.74831823419356" y="381.66814395936524" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="227.74831823419356" dy="0">七杀责任</tspan></text><text x="227.74831823419356" y="402.66814395936524" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="227.74831823419356" dy="0">Seven Killings</tspan></text><text x="227.74831823419356" y="445.66814395936524" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="227.74831823419356" dy="0">丙</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="resource"><rect x="48.51228383359043" y="152.83185604063476" width="195" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="146.01228383359043" y="174.83185604063476" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="146.01228383359043" dy="0">偏印支持</tspan></text><text x="146.01228383359043" y="195.83185604063476" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="146.01228383359043" dy="0">Indirect Resource</tspan></text><text x="146.01228383359043" y="238.83185604063476" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="146.01228383359043" dy="0">戊</tspan></text></g></svg><figcaption><p lang="zh-Hans">连线表达结构或功能路径，不代表事件因果或必然结果。</p><p lang="en">Connectors describe structural or functional paths, not event causation or guaranteed outcomes.</p></figcaption></figure></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>40 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="41" data-page-role="INTERPRETATION_A" data-section-id="S09"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>长期周期与转折模式<small lang="en">Long-Term Cycles and Turning Points</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div lang="zh-Hans" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="243" data-source-end="267" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">金的支持则更接近巩固主体性、执行连续性和边界感。</p><p data-source-start="306" data-source-end="367" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">若周期中土金得到适当体现，转折常首先发生在运作方式上：安排变得更可重复，责任边界更明确，资源不再只用于启动，也能用于维护。</p><p data-source-start="367" data-source-end="401" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">至于现实中会落在哪个领域，仍须结合具体生活资料，不能由命局单独指定。</p><p data-source-start="534" data-source-end="585" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">长期周期中的关键差别，往往不是有没有机会启动，而是启动之后是否有能力保留成果，并为已经形成的安排负责。</p></div><div lang="en" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="72" data-source-end="204" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">They alter which functions become easier to access, which ones move to the foreground, and where the greater burden must be carried.</p><p data-source-start="515" data-source-end="697" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">The essential question is whether the added influence completes the existing process or pushes production and practical commitment beyond what the structure can sustain consistently.</p><p data-source-start="699" data-source-end="866" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Periods that strengthen Earth can improve containment, allowing experience, knowledge, and ongoing matters to settle into systems, procedures, and durable foundations.</p><p data-source-start="986" data-source-end="1024" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Their purpose is not to stop movement.</p><p data-source-start="1696" data-source-end="1796" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">With adequate support, increased activity can become learning, solutions, and workable arrangements.</p><p data-source-start="2059" data-source-end="2107" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Fire must be treated as a separate timing layer.</p></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>41 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="42" data-page-role="INTERPRETATION_B" data-section-id="S09"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>长期周期与转折模式<small lang="en">Long-Term Cycles and Turning Points</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div lang="zh-Hans" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="57" data-source-end="93" data-source-role="TIMING">原局的基本路径保持不变，大运与流年所做的是调整其显著度、速度与承载条件。</p><p data-source-start="403" data-source-end="467" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">相对地，当某一阶段进一步强化流动、表达、目标展开或现实兑现时，原有路径可能更容易显现，但“更容易发动”并不等于“无条件更有利”。</p><p data-source-start="587" data-source-end="604" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">火在长期时序中的作用需要单独看待。</p><p data-source-start="727" data-source-end="763" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">因此，长期周期中的“转暖”与“变得更有利”不是同义词，仍须查看整体配合。</p><p data-source-start="765" data-source-end="792" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">地支关系会使某些转折呈现为结构重组，而不只是力量增减。</p><p data-source-start="844" data-source-end="885" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">这里的转折首先是命理结构中的重点移动，不能直接翻译为迁移、人际破裂或其他具体事件。</p><p data-source-start="1086" data-source-end="1129" data-source-role="TIMING">由于没有提供完整的大运序列、起运时间与对应年龄，本节不指定人生阶段，也不排列固定年份。</p></div><div lang="en" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="205" data-source-end="332" data-source-role="TIMING">The natal pathway remains the foundation; luck pillars and annual influences change its emphasis, pace, and support conditions.</p><p data-source-start="1025" data-source-end="1103" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">It is to give active output the means to be preserved, reviewed, and extended.</p><p data-source-start="1362" data-source-end="1466" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">Which area of life carries that change cannot be specified without corresponding real-world information.</p><p data-source-start="1468" data-source-end="1625" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">A cycle that further emphasizes movement, expression, expanded objectives, or practical realization may make the established productive pathway more visible.</p><p data-source-start="1626" data-source-end="1695" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Easier activation, however, is not the same as unconditional benefit.</p><p data-source-start="2322" data-source-end="2423" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">When Fire operates alongside stable containment, action may become more focused and momentum clearer.</p></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>42 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="43" data-page-role="SECTION_OPENER" data-section-id="S10"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-SEC-10-APPENDIX.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>当前时序<small lang="en">Current Timing</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div class="bdm-insights"><div><b>01</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="182" data-source-end="223" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">合说明两者之间产生连接与牵制，不等于已经完成五行转化；现有资料也没有给出化合结论。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="85" data-source-end="242" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">No Gregorian year, age, start date, or end date has been provided, so this combination can only be examined as a structural interaction with the natal chart.</p></div><div><b>02</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="401" data-source-end="429" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">它与原局申构成六合兼破，与原局寅构成害，并参与寅巳申刑。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="488" data-source-end="560" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Both activity and the need for coordination are consequently heightened.</p></div><div><b>03</b><p lang="zh-Hans" data-source-start="83" data-source-end="140" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">此时序所呈现的重点，并不是单一力量的到来，而是支持、调候与多重地支关系同时被引动，结构的活跃度和协调要求都会上升。</p><p lang="en" data-source-start="326" data-source-end="487" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">The central feature is not the arrival of one isolated influence, but the simultaneous activation of support, seasonal warming, and several branch relationships.</p></div></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>43 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="44" data-page-role="SECTION_DIAGRAM" data-section-id="S10"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>当前时序<small lang="en">Current Timing</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><figure data-diagram-id="D14" data-visual-grammar="TIMING_LAYERS" class=""><svg viewBox="0 0 720 720" role="img" aria-label="当前时序激活"><title>当前时序激活</title><defs><marker id="arrow-D14" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7" fill="#947439"/></marker></defs><g data-node-id="natal"><rect x="55" y="5.5" width="610" height="89" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="27.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">原局</tspan></text><text x="360" y="48.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Natal</tspan></text><text x="360" y="80.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">庚申 · 甲子 · 庚辰 · 庚寅</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="dayun"><rect x="55" y="117.5" width="610" height="89" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="139.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">当前大运</tspan></text><text x="360" y="160.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Current Da Yun</tspan></text><text x="360" y="192.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">己巳</tspan></text></g><g data-edge-from="natal" data-edge-to="dayun" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 360 94 L 360 118" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D14)"/></g><g data-node-id="annual"><rect x="55" y="229.5" width="610" height="89" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="360" y="251.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">年度层</tspan></text><text x="360" y="272.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="360" dy="0">Annual layer</tspan></text><text x="360" y="304.5" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="360" dy="0">丙寅</tspan></text></g><g data-edge-from="dayun" data-edge-to="annual" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 360 206 L 360 230" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D14)"/></g><text x="360" y="365" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-legend"><tspan x="360" dy="0">甲己合，不判化土 / Jia–Ji combination; no Earth transformation</tspan></text><text x="360" y="412" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-legend"><tspan x="360" dy="0">巳申六合兼破 / Si–Shen combination and break</tspan></text><text x="360" y="459" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-legend"><tspan x="360" dy="0">巳寅害 / Si–Yin harm</tspan></text><text x="360" y="506" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-legend"><tspan x="360" dy="0">寅巳申刑 / Yin–Si–Shen punishment</tspan></text><text x="360" y="553" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-legend"><tspan x="360" dy="0">年度寅重复原局寅 / Annual Yin repeats natal Yin</tspan></text><text x="360" y="600" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-legend"><tspan x="360" dy="0">年度寅冲原局申 / Annual Yin clashes with natal Shen</tspan></text><text x="360" y="647" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-legend"><tspan x="360" dy="0">年度寅害大运巳 / Annual Yin harms Da Yun Si</tspan></text></svg><figcaption><p lang="zh-Hans">连线表达结构或功能路径，不代表事件因果或必然结果。</p><p lang="en">Connectors describe structural or functional paths, not event causation or guaranteed outcomes.</p></figcaption></figure></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>44 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="45" data-page-role="INTERPRETATION_A" data-section-id="S10"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>当前时序<small lang="en">Current Timing</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div lang="zh-Hans" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="0" data-source-end="83" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">当前所给时序为己巳大运、丙寅流年，但其公历年份、年龄与起止日期均未提供，因此只能讨论这一组干支如何作用于原局，不能把它安放到确定的人生时间点，也不能据此断言具体事件。</p><p data-source-start="223" data-source-end="249" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">因此，己土不能被当作毫无条件、完全独立的支持来理解。</p><p data-source-start="249" data-source-end="291" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">更合适的说法是：承载、整理与稳定的需求进入前台，同时又与原有的现实展开路径相互缠连。</p><p data-source-start="429" data-source-end="461" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">合、破、害、刑同时出现，表示连接、调整、隐性牵动与结构摩擦并存。</p><p data-source-start="542" data-source-end="559" data-source-role="TIMING">丙寅流年进一步提高火与寅的显著度。</p></div><div lang="en" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="0" data-source-end="84" data-source-role="TIMING">The supplied current timing is a Ji-Si luck pillar with a Bing-Yin annual influence.</p><p data-source-start="562" data-source-end="719" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Ji Earth at the luck-pillar stem corresponds in principle with the chart’s need for containment, but it forms a Jia–Ji combination with the natal month stem.</p><p data-source-start="1513" data-source-end="1551" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Yet its role is not limited to warmth.</p><p data-source-start="2100" data-source-end="2179" data-source-role="TIMING">The Bing-Yin annual influence further heightens the visibility of Fire and Yin.</p><p data-source-start="2180" data-source-end="2304" data-source-role="TIMING">Annual Yin repeats the natal Yin, clashes with natal Shen, harms the luck-pillar Si, and reinforces the Yin–Si–Shen network.</p><p data-source-start="4487" data-source-end="4561" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">Fire may warm and activate, but it cannot replace Earth-and-Metal support.</p></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>45 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="46" data-page-role="INTERPRETATION_B" data-section-id="S10"><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>当前时序<small lang="en">Current Timing</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div lang="zh-Hans" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="559" data-source-end="598" data-source-role="TIMING">年度寅重复原局寅，又冲原局申，并与大运巳相害，同时继续强化寅巳申刑的关系网络。</p><p data-source-start="662" data-source-end="699" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">这里所说的是结构压力的集中，而不是对迁移、人际冲突、健康或其他事件的预测。</p><p data-source-start="699" data-source-end="738" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">寅申冲也不会取消原有三合，原有三合更不会抹去当前被强化的冲；两种机制仍须并读。</p><p data-source-start="810" data-source-end="849" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">但这需要土的承接真正进入执行层面，也需要金所代表的边界与持续性没有被过度消耗。</p><p data-source-start="849" data-source-end="907" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">若规则清楚、职责有限、复核机制存在，多重引动可以表现为密集而有效的调整，使旧安排得到更新，新要求被纳入可管理的秩序。</p><p data-source-start="1141" data-source-end="1166" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">因此，当前时序的核心是“在加速与重组中建立承载”。</p><p data-source-start="1232" data-source-end="1260" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">由于没有公历年份、年龄及事件资料，本节不延伸到具体预测。</p></div><div lang="en" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="243" data-source-end="325" data-source-role="BOUNDARY">It cannot be assigned to a definite life stage or used to assert a concrete event.</p><p data-source-start="720" data-source-end="888" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Combination establishes connection and mutual involvement; it does not by itself establish elemental transformation, and no transformation conclusion has been supplied.</p><p data-source-start="994" data-source-end="1187" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">A more precise reading is that organization, stabilization, and carrying capacity move to the foreground while becoming intertwined with the chart’s existing route toward practical realization.</p><p data-source-start="1408" data-source-end="1512" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Si introduces Fire and therefore carries a climate-regulating implication within the cold natal setting.</p><p data-source-start="2415" data-source-end="2548" data-source-role="TIMING">As one arrangement moves forward, it may be pulled simultaneously by the natal structure, the long-term cycle, and the annual demand.</p><p data-source-start="4144" data-source-end="4235" data-source-role="COUNTERWEIGHT">If shared support exists only verbally, hidden overload may still concentrate in one place.</p></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生 / Your life, in context</span><span>46 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="47" data-page-role="INTEGRATED_MAP" data-section-id=""><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字 / BaZi</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>八字整合运行图<small lang="en">Integrated BaZi Map</small></h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><figure data-diagram-id="D15" data-visual-grammar="INTEGRATED_RADIAL" class=""><svg viewBox="0 0 720 540" role="img" aria-label="八字整合运行图"><title>八字整合运行图</title><defs><marker id="arrow-D15" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7" fill="#947439"/></marker></defs><g data-edge-from="day" data-edge-to="peer" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 360 180 L 360 125" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D15)"/></g><g data-edge-from="day" data-edge-to="output" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 419.36266477570734 212.90452816411423 L 492.18604842896 167.39751146413906" class="bdm-edge " marker-end="url(#arrow-D15)"/></g><g data-edge-from="day" data-edge-to="wealth" data-edge-type="FUNCTIONAL"><path d="M 428.5433615743164 264.20589962278075 L 530.31397691