eader><div class="pub-heading"><h2>Bring the Reading into Life</h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div lang="en" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="0" data-source-end="87" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">The principal vulnerability in this chart is not simply the volume of external demands.</p><p data-source-start="0" data-source-end="71" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">Long-term cycles do not replace the natal structure with a new destiny.</p><p data-source-start="85" data-source-end="242" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">No Gregorian year, age, start date, or end date has been provided, so this combination can only be examined as a structural interaction with the natal chart.</p></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>Your life, in context</span><span>48 / 48</span></footer></section></article></body></html>
