" dy="0">七杀责任</tspan></text><text x="466.30151608380174" y="532.2228396175565" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="466.30151608380174" dy="0">丙</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="resource"><rect x="167.69848391619826" y="482.2228396175565" width="172" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="253.69848391619826" y="506.2228396175565" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="253.69848391619826" dy="0">偏印支持</tspan></text><text x="253.69848391619826" y="532.2228396175565" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="253.69848391619826" dy="0">戊</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="timing"><rect x="35.14266151545323" y="326.17981480995235" width="172" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="121.14266151545323" y="350.17981480995235" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="121.14266151545323" dy="0">大运 · 年度</tspan></text><text x="121.14266151545323" y="376.17981480995235" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="121.14266151545323" dy="0">己巳 / 丙寅</tspan></text></g><g data-node-id="relations"><rect x="82.45128679533266" y="131.59734557249132" width="172" height="100" rx="12" class="bdm-node"/><text x="168.45128679533266" y="155.59734557249132" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-diagram-label"><tspan x="168.45128679533266" dy="0">原局关系</tspan></text><text x="168.45128679533266" y="181.59734557249132" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="168.45128679533266" dy="0">申子辰三合 ·</tspan></text><text x="168.45128679533266" y="207.59734557249132" text-anchor="middle" class="bdm-node-value"><tspan x="168.45128679533266" dy="0">寅申冲</tspan></text></g></svg><figcaption><p lang="zh-Hans">连线表达结构或功能路径，不代表事件因果或必然结果。</p></figcaption></figure></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生</span><span>47 / 48</span></footer></section><section class="pub-page bdm-page" data-page-number="48" data-page-role="CLOSING_REALITY_BRIDGE" data-section-id=""><div class="pub-decoration pub-decoration--single"><img class="pub-page-background" src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp" alt=""></div><header class="pub-header"><span>P H I O S</span><span>八字</span></header><div class="pub-heading"><h2>把解读带回生活</h2></div><div class="bdm-content"><div lang="zh-Hans" class="bdm-locale"><p data-source-start="177" data-source-end="219" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">这种结构在顺畅状态下，往往表现为能够发现问题、拆解复杂信息，并把想法转成可执行成果。</p><p data-source-start="0" data-source-end="57" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">长期周期的作用，不是替原局重新定义一个命运，而是在不同阶段改变哪些结构功能更容易被调用、哪些环节需要承担更大负荷。</p><p data-source-start="182" data-source-end="223" data-source-role="DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION">合说明两者之间产生连接与牵制，不等于已经完成五行转化；现有资料也没有给出化合结论。</p></div></div><footer class="pub-footer"><span>在情境中理解人生</span><span>48 / 48</span></footer></section></article></body></html>
